(5646197, 820989, 29486, '<td valign="top">No real focus here and it''s overprocessed. The point of this kind of shot is to show the interior, not to make it artsy. If it had water puddles, broken walls and such, then you can process it to your hearts content.</td>', 'No real focus here and it''s overprocessed. The point of this kind of shot is to show the interior, not to make it artsy. If it had water puddles, broken walls and such, then you can process it to your hearts content.', '2009-09-14 02:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
