(5647605, 820923, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is conceivably the best example of HDR I''ve ever seen. Exquisite....10</td>', 'This is conceivably the best example of HDR I''ve ever seen. Exquisite....10', '2009-09-15 07:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5647607, 820945, 5792, '<td valign="top">If you have Lightroom you can remove the dark smokiness surrounding the clouds. Select the airbrush tool and pick "exposure" and "-" for the air brush settings adjusted to about +.5 f/stops or so for starters and airbrush the smokiness away from the cloud edges. It is a bit tricky to avoid unevenness but pretty easy with a practiced hand and produces a very natural looking result.<br/> <br/>You can achieve the same result with an Exposure Layer in PS CS4 but, of course as is true with everything in PS, it is a lot harder. :)</td>', 'If you have Lightroom you can remove the dark smokiness surrounding the clouds. Select the airbrush tool and pick "exposure" and "-" for the air brush settings adjusted to about +.5 f/stops or so for starters and airbrush the smokiness away from the cloud edges. It is a bit tricky to avoid unevenness but pretty easy with a practiced hand and produces a very natural looking result. You can achieve the same result with an Exposure Layer in PS CS4 but, of course as is true with everything in PS, it is a lot harder. :)', '2009-09-15 07:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5647610, 820465, 67152, '<td valign="top">freakin'' hilarious! and well done to boot!</td>', 'freakin'' hilarious! and well done to boot!', '2009-09-15 07:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
