(5647688, 820483, 72068, '<td valign="top">Those clouds really help this photograph, a really natural looking HDR, the colours are really punchy without being too overly saturated, and the contrast between the rolling stock and the orangy (rusted) track is effective.</td>', 'Those clouds really help this photograph, a really natural looking HDR, the colours are really punchy without being too overly saturated, and the contrast between the rolling stock and the orangy (rusted) track is effective.', '2009-09-15 09:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
