(5648441, 821040, 104650, '<td valign="top">The scene was chosen great for an HDR picture, and the composition is great. The processing looks too artificial for me, in particular, I don''t like the "airbrush look" on the car. (The airbrush look also stands out in one of the other pictures, it has a bike in it).</td>', 'The scene was chosen great for an HDR picture, and the composition is great. The processing looks too artificial for me, in particular, I don''t like the "airbrush look" on the car. (The airbrush look also stands out in one of the other pictures, it has a bike in it).', '2009-09-15 18:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648445, 820900, 56797, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I would prefer it much more if the horizon wasn''t tilted but otherwise very nice and very peaceful. 8</td>', 'Lovely shot. I would prefer it much more if the horizon wasn''t tilted but otherwise very nice and very peaceful. 8', '2009-09-15 18:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
