(5648462, 820715, 56797, '<td valign="top">looks like it needs more contrast. Seems very "cloudy". I do like the concept for HDR and I think if you had gotten more of the building and less or even no sky it would be very cool.</td>', 'looks like it needs more contrast. Seems very "cloudy". I do like the concept for HDR and I think if you had gotten more of the building and less or even no sky it would be very cool.', '2009-09-15 18:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648464, 820206, 56797, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... This reminds me of someone elses work. Not sure you are him though. It''s lacking a subtle pizzaz. But I do love the soft glow you''ve achieved. Lovely image.</td>', 'Hmmmm... This reminds me of someone elses work. Not sure you are him though. It''s lacking a subtle pizzaz. But I do love the soft glow you''ve achieved. Lovely image.', '2009-09-15 18:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648467, 820096, 62357, '<td valign="top">I think the less is more approach works a bit better with the HDR tools.  I like the composition of this image, but the processing really is a bit over the top.</td>', 'I think the less is more approach works a bit better with the HDR tools.  I like the composition of this image, but the processing really is a bit over the top.', '2009-09-15 18:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648471, 820878, 56797, '<td valign="top">This one confuses me. It almost seems too dark(part of me is dying for it to have a brighter focal point) but on the other hand that makes it soooo serene. I think I prefer it this way. Good Luck in the challenge. 7</td>', 'This one confuses me. It almost seems too dark(part of me is dying for it to have a brighter focal point) but on the other hand that makes it soooo serene. I think I prefer it this way. Good Luck in the challenge. 7', '2009-09-15 18:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648473, 821012, 62357, '<td valign="top">Not so sure about the sky in this one - there is haloing around the trees.  Shame, it''s otherwise a nice image (still it got a 6 from me)</td>', 'Not so sure about the sky in this one - there is haloing around the trees.  Shame, it''s otherwise a nice image (still it got a 6 from me)', '2009-09-15 18:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648478, 820771, 62357, '<td valign="top">As with a lot of others in the challenge, the sky is what is stopping me bumping this to a 7 from a 6.  I always find it so hard to get the sky right when doing HDR/tone mapping.</td>', 'As with a lot of others in the challenge, the sky is what is stopping me bumping this to a 7 from a 6.  I always find it so hard to get the sky right when doing HDR/tone mapping.', '2009-09-15 18:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
