(5648481, 820922, 56797, '<td valign="top">This looks very pixelated or something. I can''t quite tell what the issue is. My guesses: You used a canvas or crosshatch filter on it, bad quality photo to begin with, over sharpened, or the method in which you saved it to the web compressed it badly. Either way, the photo would look much better without whatever you''ve done to it. It seems like a very nice location, but would be better if it looked more natural.<br/>HTH</td>', 'This looks very pixelated or something. I can''t quite tell what the issue is. My guesses: You used a canvas or crosshatch filter on it, bad quality photo to begin with, over sharpened, or the method in which you saved it to the web compressed it badly. Either way, the photo would look much better without whatever you''ve done to it. It seems like a very nice location, but would be better if it looked more natural.HTH', '2009-09-15 18:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648482, 820844, 62357, '<td valign="top">Actually I really like the ghosting of the people in this, but the haloing around the roof and steeple (although sort of ironic given the subject) stop me from giving this a 7.</td>', 'Actually I really like the ghosting of the people in this, but the haloing around the roof and steeple (although sort of ironic given the subject) stop me from giving this a 7.', '2009-09-15 18:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
