(5648485, 820919, 62357, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and you have done very well to bring out the details in this.  Would like it to have a bit more contrast though as it feels a bit flat.</td>', 'Like the composition and you have done very well to bring out the details in this.  Would like it to have a bit more contrast though as it feels a bit flat.', '2009-09-15 18:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
