(5648604, 820592, 69668, '<td valign="top">I like this image....it seems a bit quirky to me, which is why I am drawn to it.  9</td>', 'I like this image....it seems a bit quirky to me, which is why I am drawn to it.  9', '2009-09-15 21:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648606, 820923, 72670, '<td valign="top">Very picturesque! I would prefer to see a little more blacks in the hills in the distance. Without the blacks it just seems too flat and grey to me.</td>', 'Very picturesque! I would prefer to see a little more blacks in the hills in the distance. Without the blacks it just seems too flat and grey to me.', '2009-09-15 21:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648609, 820962, 72670, '<td valign="top">Very crisp with plenty of detail!</td>', 'Very crisp with plenty of detail!', '2009-09-15 21:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648612, 821005, 72670, '<td valign="top">Very well pprocessed with great content! The grey sky is perfect for this setting. 8</td>', 'Very well pprocessed with great content! The grey sky is perfect for this setting. 8', '2009-09-15 21:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648613, 821096, 72670, '<td valign="top">A nice change from all the rest of the entries. Hope most voters agree that HDR is not exclusivley funky colours. Good Luck! 8</td>', 'A nice change from all the rest of the entries. Hope most voters agree that HDR is not exclusivley funky colours. Good Luck! 8', '2009-09-15 21:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648616, 820410, 72670, '<td valign="top">Sharp image with nice colour. I llike how the structure seperates the blue and the red at opposite corners. 8</td>', 'Sharp image with nice colour. I llike how the structure seperates the blue and the red at opposite corners. 8', '2009-09-15 21:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648621, 820795, 72670, '<td valign="top">I am assuming this is from the Toronto air show. I am impressed with the quality of the image! Those planes were flying real low, giving people a chance to capture some good shots.. like this one. Good Luck!</td>', 'I am assuming this is from the Toronto air show. I am impressed with the quality of the image! Those planes were flying real low, giving people a chance to capture some good shots.. like this one. Good Luck!', '2009-09-15 21:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648625, 821058, 72670, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect example of HDR that doesn''t need colour! The only thing that bothers me is the oversharpening? on the brush and rocks in the foreground.</td>', 'This is a perfect example of HDR that doesn''t need colour! The only thing that bothers me is the oversharpening? on the brush and rocks in the foreground.', '2009-09-15 21:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648643, 820795, 56109, '<td valign="top">By far, one of the best in the challenge. I''m interested to find out how you did HDR in motion so well. The ability to see the pilot and the air coming off the wings add so much to the overall quality of the image. The only thing I don''t like is the "white glow" around the plane.</td>', 'By far, one of the best in the challenge. I''m interested to find out how you did HDR in motion so well. The ability to see the pilot and the air coming off the wings add so much to the overall quality of the image. The only thing I don''t like is the "white glow" around the plane.', '2009-09-15 21:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648674, 820526, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and texture.  You''ve managed an HDR image without going over the top.  It looks very natural.</td>', 'Lovely colors and texture.  You''ve managed an HDR image without going over the top.  It looks very natural.', '2009-09-15 22:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648676, 820923, 7743, '<td valign="top">I can just feel the crispness in the air.  Lovely and natural looking.</td>', 'I can just feel the crispness in the air.  Lovely and natural looking.', '2009-09-15 22:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648678, 819840, 7743, '<td valign="top">Just a tad over done for my taste but still a lovely image.  Great use of the diagonal. 8</td>', 'Just a tad over done for my taste but still a lovely image.  Great use of the diagonal. 8', '2009-09-15 22:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648680, 820959, 7743, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast.  B&amp;W fits the subject matter perfectly.</td>', 'Excellent contrast.  B&W fits the subject matter perfectly.', '2009-09-15 22:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648681, 820779, 7743, '<td valign="top">Love the soft milky look to the water.  Excellent detail in the rocks.</td>', 'Love the soft milky look to the water.  Excellent detail in the rocks.', '2009-09-15 22:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648683, 820715, 7743, '<td valign="top">This gives the feeling of looking out one''s own window across the way to another building.</td>', 'This gives the feeling of looking out one''s own window across the way to another building.', '2009-09-15 22:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648688, 820171, 47541, '<td valign="top">I have given this a 5. The reason for the 5 are that as a photo it is pleasant with plenty of interest (believe me I gave many votes less than a 5 in this one!) Why I didn''t vote higher is that while this shot may be an HDR processed one, it''s not obvious that it was. In saying that I don''t mean it has to be a fisher-price coloured over-the-top shot but. The extra range that I''d hope to see in a shot from the HDR is not evident in this for me. Not having seen the originals it''s hard to say what you worked from so it may be obvious to you what the benefit of the HDR was but it doesn''t come through that well in this shot for me.</td>', 'I have given this a 5. The reason for the 5 are that as a photo it is pleasant with plenty of interest (believe me I gave many votes less than a 5 in this one!) Why I didn''t vote higher is that while this shot may be an HDR processed one, it''s not obvious that it was. In saying that I don''t mean it has to be a fisher-price coloured over-the-top shot but. The extra range that I''d hope to see in a shot from the HDR is not evident in this for me. Not having seen the originals it''s hard to say what you worked from so it may be obvious to you what the benefit of the HDR was but it doesn''t come through that well in this shot for me.', '2009-09-15 22:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648701, 820559, 98647, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours.</td>', 'Lovely colours.', '2009-09-15 22:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648714, 819840, 98647, '<td valign="top">Blue - that was the first thing that struck me when I saw this shot. The hint of blue in the rocks against the vibrant blue of the sky works really well. Not usually a fan of centred horizons, but I like it here.</td>', 'Blue - that was the first thing that struck me when I saw this shot. The hint of blue in the rocks against the vibrant blue of the sky works really well. Not usually a fan of centred horizons, but I like it here.', '2009-09-15 23:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648731, 820922, 90626, '<td valign="top">looks somewhat noisy and somewhat digitized to me</td>', 'looks somewhat noisy and somewhat digitized to me', '2009-09-15 23:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648733, 820590, 25787, '<td valign="top">Pretty seen, but it needs something more interesting in the foreground.</td>', 'Pretty seen, but it needs something more interesting in the foreground.', '2009-09-15 23:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648737, 820732, 90626, '<td valign="top">looks over-saturated to me</td>', 'looks over-saturated to me', '2009-09-15 23:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648742, 820465, 90626, '<td valign="top">love it!!</td>', 'love it!!', '2009-09-15 23:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648755, 820795, 90626, '<td valign="top">very nice indeed!</td>', 'very nice indeed!', '2009-09-15 23:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648765, 820945, 98647, '<td valign="top">I wish the sky was more interesting because it makes up most of the shot.</td>', 'I wish the sky was more interesting because it makes up most of the shot.', '2009-09-15 23:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648771, 821101, 90626, '<td valign="top">seems over-saturated to me but I really like the scene</td>', 'seems over-saturated to me but I really like the scene', '2009-09-15 23:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648779, 820945, 90626, '<td valign="top">very crisp. nice!</td>', 'very crisp. nice!', '2009-09-15 23:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648801, 821094, 98647, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit overdone, but it works for this subject. I like the colours. I think the composition could be improved by having the steering wheel a little more off centre.</td>', 'It''s a bit overdone, but it works for this subject. I like the colours. I think the composition could be improved by having the steering wheel a little more off centre.', '2009-09-15 23:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648831, 820096, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the bold colors, but overall this is coming across to me as overprocessed and somewhat garish. Sorry.</td>', 'I like the bold colors, but overall this is coming across to me as overprocessed and somewhat garish. Sorry.', '2009-09-16 00:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648835, 820167, 83313, '<td valign="top">Killed by mobile phones. A shame too, the UK phone booths really have some style to them.</td>', 'Killed by mobile phones. A shame too, the UK phone booths really have some style to them.', '2009-09-16 00:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648836, 820529, 83313, '<td valign="top">The treatment works well, making the fine veins of the petals into the star of this shot. I''m not a huge floral fan, but I can recognize well done, nonetheless.</td>', 'The treatment works well, making the fine veins of the petals into the star of this shot. I''m not a huge floral fan, but I can recognize well done, nonetheless.', '2009-09-16 00:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648840, 820878, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit on the subtle side, just a bit of the stereotypical "HDR look". I like the golden tones and the treetop appears to have a rectangular form that catches my eye.</td>', 'A bit on the subtle side, just a bit of the stereotypical "HDR look". I like the golden tones and the treetop appears to have a rectangular form that catches my eye.', '2009-09-16 00:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648842, 821033, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well done enough, but something about it is not really grabbing my eye. Perhaps my gaze is not being drawn through the frame to anything in particular.</td>', 'Well done enough, but something about it is not really grabbing my eye. Perhaps my gaze is not being drawn through the frame to anything in particular.', '2009-09-16 00:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648847, 820552, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good use of the treatment to deal with the heavy shadows and bright highlights of midday sun. I find myself looking in the tunnel to see if <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio.php?USER_ID=62187&amp;collection_id=34522" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Clark</a> is in there.</td>', 'Good use of the treatment to deal with the heavy shadows and bright highlights of midday sun. I find myself looking in the tunnel to see if Clark is in there.', '2009-09-16 00:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648849, 820634, 83313, '<td valign="top">C''mon, you knew this would do well, didn''t you?</td>', 'C''mon, you knew this would do well, didn''t you?', '2009-09-16 00:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648850, 820889, 83313, '<td valign="top">The treatment makes this look like an illustration from a video game. Kinda neat.</td>', 'The treatment makes this look like an illustration from a video game. Kinda neat.', '2009-09-16 00:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648853, 821088, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not impacting me much, and I don''t know why. This has a look of a Japanese painting that ought to sit well with me. If I can nail down something more specific, I will update this comment.</td>', 'Not impacting me much, and I don''t know why. This has a look of a Japanese painting that ought to sit well with me. If I can nail down something more specific, I will update this comment.', '2009-09-16 00:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648856, 820708, 83313, '<td valign="top">A scene that is made for this treatment. Personally, I like to turn down the yellow a little on the foliage, so it appears more green, but that''s a personal preference thing.</td>', 'A scene that is made for this treatment. Personally, I like to turn down the yellow a little on the foliage, so it appears more green, but that''s a personal preference thing.', '2009-09-16 00:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648858, 821091, 83313, '<td valign="top">Obviously not made form multiple exposures, unless you had him glued up there. You did a good job of using HDR techniques to pull the scene from what were certainly deep shadows.</td>', 'Obviously not made form multiple exposures, unless you had him glued up there. You did a good job of using HDR techniques to pull the scene from what were certainly deep shadows.', '2009-09-16 00:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648859, 820559, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is just a wonderful storybook scene. The only minor thing that hurts the illusion is that small sign on the left, which could have been cloned out under advanced rules.</td>', 'This is just a wonderful storybook scene. The only minor thing that hurts the illusion is that small sign on the left, which could have been cloned out under advanced rules.', '2009-09-16 00:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648868, 820732, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure where to start. I''m afraid I''m having to leave a fairly low vote on this entry. The image size is smaller than it could have been. You should use the maximum allowed size in at least one direction. You''ve also lost a lot of detail here, probably from the choice of processing, but possibly from the resizing effort as well I''d be interested in seeing the original and if there is anything different that can be done for it.</td>', 'Not sure where to start. I''m afraid I''m having to leave a fairly low vote on this entry. The image size is smaller than it could have been. You should use the maximum allowed size in at least one direction. You''ve also lost a lot of detail here, probably from the choice of processing, but possibly from the resizing effort as well I''d be interested in seeing the original and if there is anything different that can be done for it.', '2009-09-16 00:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648869, 820914, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great, smooth reflections and a good, but not over the top use of the techniques.</td>', 'Great, smooth reflections and a good, but not over the top use of the techniques.', '2009-09-16 00:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648872, 821093, 16046, '<td valign="top">Cool, love the green</td>', 'Cool, love the green', '2009-09-16 00:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648873, 820518, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, good work</td>', 'Nice tones, good work', '2009-09-16 00:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648877, 820455, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice smile</td>', 'Nice smile', '2009-09-16 00:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648878, 820141, 16046, '<td valign="top">Nice, love this place</td>', 'Nice, love this place', '2009-09-16 00:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648901, 820631, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off a bit dark to me. It''s not having too much impact, though pics of trains are usually a subject I like. Perhaps the strong browny-yellows in the scene are just overpowering me. Not totally sure.</td>', 'Comes off a bit dark to me. It''s not having too much impact, though pics of trains are usually a subject I like. Perhaps the strong browny-yellows in the scene are just overpowering me. Not totally sure.', '2009-09-16 00:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648902, 820305, 83313, '<td valign="top">I hope this tug is not another addition to the ribbon hogging Too family!</td>', 'I hope this tug is not another addition to the ribbon hogging Too family!', '2009-09-16 00:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648907, 820715, 83313, '<td valign="top">There are aspects of this I really like, such as the clean outlines of the building, and the boldly lit windows. Very smooth overall. The composition and slight curvature are not sitting well with me though.</td>', 'There are aspects of this I really like, such as the clean outlines of the building, and the boldly lit windows. Very smooth overall. The composition and slight curvature are not sitting well with me though.', '2009-09-16 00:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648909, 820987, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great landscape. I like the use of the grass in the foreground. Definitley HDR techniques, but not overdone.</td>', 'Great landscape. I like the use of the grass in the foreground. Definitley HDR techniques, but not overdone.', '2009-09-16 00:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648910, 820374, 83313, '<td valign="top">An average flower shot to me. I can see how nicely the HDR techniques have helped the details to stand out, but it''s not going over either really well nor poorly with me. keep in mind I am not a big floral fan, so one has to really stand out to get my attention.</td>', 'An average flower shot to me. I can see how nicely the HDR techniques have helped the details to stand out, but it''s not going over either really well nor poorly with me. keep in mind I am not a big floral fan, so one has to really stand out to get my attention.', '2009-09-16 00:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648912, 820927, 83313, '<td valign="top">The HDR helps with the high midday sun, but not enough. I''ll bet an evening shot of this place would be awesome.</td>', 'The HDR helps with the high midday sun, but not enough. I''ll bet an evening shot of this place would be awesome.', '2009-09-16 00:57:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5648915, 820694, 83313, '<td valign="top">I have no doubt this is doing well. I hope the effort to get here has paid off in your score. I think I am faving this one.</td>', 'I have no doubt this is doing well. I hope the effort to get here has paid off in your score. I think I am faving this one.', '2009-09-16 00:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648918, 820465, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to think of a smartbutt comment and coming up blank. Will a 9 work instead? Thought it would.</td>', 'I''m trying to think of a smartbutt comment and coming up blank. Will a 9 work instead? Thought it would.', '2009-09-16 00:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648924, 821025, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sky is a bit grainy, and the overall scene comes off to me a bit on the bright side.</td>', 'Sky is a bit grainy, and the overall scene comes off to me a bit on the bright side.', '2009-09-16 01:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648927, 820672, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost overprocessed, but the look works well for this scene of contrasts.</td>', 'Almost overprocessed, but the look works well for this scene of contrasts.', '2009-09-16 01:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648934, 820916, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of the scene. That was an effective use of the phone pole, which is usually a distracting element. Could perhaps use a touch more noise reduction in the clouds.</td>', 'I like the framing of the scene. That was an effective use of the phone pole, which is usually a distracting element. Could perhaps use a touch more noise reduction in the clouds.', '2009-09-16 01:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648936, 820960, 83313, '<td valign="top">This seems soft and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 36k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)</td>', 'This seems soft and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 36k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)', '2009-09-16 01:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648943, 821094, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is screaming <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=63398" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Nikonjeb</a> to me. If this is not Jeb''s entry, then that should be taken as a compliment.</td>', 'This is screaming  Nikonjeb to me. If this is not Jeb''s entry, then that should be taken as a compliment.', '2009-09-16 01:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648946, 820844, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little dark haloing around the roofline, but otherwise, I like the desaturated, more subtle look of this.</td>', 'A little dark haloing around the roofline, but otherwise, I like the desaturated, more subtle look of this.', '2009-09-16 01:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
