(5648961, 820748, 83313, '<td valign="top">Doe not give any visual indication to me of the use of HDR techniques. That may just indicate you effectively pulled out the natural appearance where it mattered to you. The overall scene seem somewhat pixelated, with coarse detail.</td>', 'Doe not give any visual indication to me of the use of HDR techniques. That may just indicate you effectively pulled out the natural appearance where it mattered to you. The overall scene seem somewhat pixelated, with coarse detail.', '2009-09-16 01:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648970, 820923, 32011, '<td valign="top">This has BLUE Ribbon written all over it.  If this doesn''t win I''ll... I''ll... I''ll do something crazy... but I''m not going to put too much effort into thinking what because it''ll be a waste of time because this is a certainty for the blue.  I can''t fault it at all... it''s sharp, it''s interesting, the colours are beautiful, the composition is brilliant... I''m running out of superlatives... so, I guess I should bump the 9 I gave it during my voting phase to a <b>10</b>! I never give 10s... well almost never, and I''m giving this a 10... and I guess it''d make sense to favourite this too.  OUTSTANDING!! LOVE IT!!!</td>', 'This has BLUE Ribbon written all over it.  If this doesn''t win I''ll... I''ll... I''ll do something crazy... but I''m not going to put too much effort into thinking what because it''ll be a waste of time because this is a certainty for the blue.  I can''t fault it at all... it''s sharp, it''s interesting, the colours are beautiful, the composition is brilliant... I''m running out of superlatives... so, I guess I should bump the 9 I gave it during my voting phase to a 10! I never give 10s... well almost never, and I''m giving this a 10... and I guess it''d make sense to favourite this too.  OUTSTANDING!! LOVE IT!!!', '2009-09-16 01:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648974, 821078, 32011, '<td valign="top">A definite contender for a ribbon.  I bumped this up from an 8 which O gave during my voting phase, to a 9.  Image is sharp and composition is great... colour and contrast is just an iota flat IMO.  That said, this is a brilliant photo... well done.</td>', 'A definite contender for a ribbon.  I bumped this up from an 8 which O gave during my voting phase, to a 9.  Image is sharp and composition is great... colour and contrast is just an iota flat IMO.  That said, this is a brilliant photo... well done.', '2009-09-16 01:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648976, 819840, 32011, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely fantastic... composition, colour, detail... brilliant!  I upgraded my vote from 8 to 9 and reckon this is in the running for a ribbon.</td>', 'This is an absolutely fantastic... composition, colour, detail... brilliant!  I upgraded my vote from 8 to 9 and reckon this is in the running for a ribbon.', '2009-09-16 01:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5648978, 820634, 32011, '<td valign="top">Ohhh.... NICE!  This is beautiful.  Colour, composition, detail... LOVE IT ALL!  If this doesn''t get a ribbon, I''ll be EXTREMELY surprised!</td>', 'Ohhh.... NICE!  This is beautiful.  Colour, composition, detail... LOVE IT ALL!  If this doesn''t get a ribbon, I''ll be EXTREMELY surprised!', '2009-09-16 01:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
