(5650434, 820735, 81213, '<td valign="top">The HDR isn''t really noticable in this. But I amke a commitment to try and give posetive feedback even when the photo doesnt exactly meet the challenge description... I like the textures a lot, but the photo just isnt very interesting. The background needs to be filled with something, maybe a lake, of a river setting. And I''d use a photo editing program to add some dynamics to the lighting, that''s a bit flat as well.</td>', 'The HDR isn''t really noticable in this. But I amke a commitment to try and give posetive feedback even when the photo doesnt exactly meet the challenge description... I like the textures a lot, but the photo just isnt very interesting. The background needs to be filled with something, maybe a lake, of a river setting. And I''d use a photo editing program to add some dynamics to the lighting, that''s a bit flat as well.', '2009-09-16 21:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650435, 820694, 81213, '<td valign="top">That''s really spectacular... I''d love to see it a bit darker, and with some more contrast between the left and right sides of the ridge. 6/10</td>', 'That''s really spectacular... I''d love to see it a bit darker, and with some more contrast between the left and right sides of the ridge. 6/10', '2009-09-16 21:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650437, 820908, 81213, '<td valign="top">Interesting tree leaves and their color. Like the light shining through, but I wouldn''t consider this heavily HRD''d. Like the feeling and texture though. 5/10</td>', 'Interesting tree leaves and their color. Like the light shining through, but I wouldn''t consider this heavily HRD''d. Like the feeling and texture though. 5/10', '2009-09-16 21:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650441, 821096, 81213, '<td valign="top">That''s absolutely beautiful. I love the reflections, but I''d like to see this a bit darker. But without ruining the muted colors of the trees and their leaves. Like the spots of light on the water, the image needs a tad bit more contrast, and a sharper focus. i can see you tried your best form the USM hot spots. Anyway, I could totally see this winning a ribbon. Maybe not blue but at least yellow. 7/10</td>', 'That''s absolutely beautiful. I love the reflections, but I''d like to see this a bit darker. But without ruining the muted colors of the trees and their leaves. Like the spots of light on the water, the image needs a tad bit more contrast, and a sharper focus. i can see you tried your best form the USM hot spots. Anyway, I could totally see this winning a ribbon. Maybe not blue but at least yellow. 7/10', '2009-09-16 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650444, 820989, 81213, '<td valign="top">Looks a little draganized, but its hard to tell the difference. Should be a bit darker, more grungy... 5/10 Could be better. Good job, love the wood textures and colors!!!</td>', 'Looks a little draganized, but its hard to tell the difference. Should be a bit darker, more grungy... 5/10 Could be better. Good job, love the wood textures and colors!!!', '2009-09-16 21:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650447, 821038, 81213, '<td valign="top">Instant 7/10, love it. No fav, but still, this is great. Good luck with ribbon. A little noise up in the sky but I cant blame you for that. Darkening the image might make hat a little less noticeable and make the colors of the sky pop a bit more as well as the city... 7/10</td>', 'Instant 7/10, love it. No fav, but still, this is great. Good luck with ribbon. A little noise up in the sky but I cant blame you for that. Darkening the image might make hat a little less noticeable and make the colors of the sky pop a bit more as well as the city... 7/10', '2009-09-16 21:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650448, 820610, 81213, '<td valign="top">Pretty textures, but the blurry flowers in the background take away form that... Nice lighting and colors. 5/10</td>', 'Pretty textures, but the blurry flowers in the background take away form that... Nice lighting and colors. 5/10', '2009-09-16 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
