(5650453, 820509, 81213, '<td valign="top">Wow, the perspective in this keeps me wondering, lets you stay looking at the image for more then a second. Good job, textures and colors. Lighting is about as good as it could be, but a slight crop to the left and a bit of levels work in photoshop would have made this a 8/10... My final score is 7</td>', 'Wow, the perspective in this keeps me wondering, lets you stay looking at the image for more then a second. Good job, textures and colors. Lighting is about as good as it could be, but a slight crop to the left and a bit of levels work in photoshop would have made this a 8/10... My final score is 7', '2009-09-16 21:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650454, 820829, 81213, '<td valign="top">Simple HDR, I like it. But I wish you has some more overall color contrast to give it some grunge. Love this, but it seems like something that should be dark and scary even. 5/10</td>', 'Simple HDR, I like it. But I wish you has some more overall color contrast to give it some grunge. Love this, but it seems like something that should be dark and scary even. 5/10', '2009-09-16 21:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
