(5650458, 820779, 81213, '<td valign="top">These challenge entries are getting better and better! It''s a bit grainy in the bottom left corner and the sky could have some better coloring. But you still got a fav from me as well as an 8/10 hope you win ribbon!</td>', 'These challenge entries are getting better and better! It''s a bit grainy in the bottom left corner and the sky could have some better coloring. But you still got a fav from me as well as an 8/10 hope you win ribbon!', '2009-09-16 21:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
