(5650575, 820907, 81213, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic macro shot. Just wish the area a bit south of the spider was in a little more focus. But maybe you wanted this effect. God luck! 6</td>', 'Absolutely fantastic macro shot. Just wish the area a bit south of the spider was in a little more focus. But maybe you wanted this effect. God luck! 6', '2009-09-16 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
