(5650586, 820945, 81213, '<td valign="top">Nice big open skies... I like that, but HDR is left out of his. I''d love to see this with a better HDR effect. Anyway, good luck!</td>', 'Nice big open skies... I like that, but HDR is left out of his. I''d love to see this with a better HDR effect. Anyway, good luck!', '2009-09-16 22:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
