(5650592, 820791, 81213, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... Absolutely beautiful... Not exactly sure whats going on with the bottom of the corn. But the colors are just amazing and processing is great. 7/10</td>', 'Beautiful... Absolutely beautiful... Not exactly sure whats going on with the bottom of the corn. But the colors are just amazing and processing is great. 7/10', '2009-09-16 22:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
