(5650624, 820559, 81213, '<td valign="top">I''m in love. This need to get a blue ribbon. Or nobody gets a blue ribbon. Amazing sky colors. Only thing, tree near the edge of the windmill is a little distracting. but I can look past that I swear. Instant fav, ill check out your page when challenge is over...</td>', 'I''m in love. This need to get a blue ribbon. Or nobody gets a blue ribbon. Amazing sky colors. Only thing, tree near the edge of the windmill is a little distracting. but I can look past that I swear. Instant fav, ill check out your page when challenge is over...', '2009-09-16 22:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650625, 821101, 108687, '<td valign="top">Great color range here.</td>', 'Great color range here.', '2009-09-16 22:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
