(5650664, 821103, 81213, '<td valign="top">Too dark, can''t really see much.</td>', 'Too dark, can''t really see much.', '2009-09-16 22:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650665, 821053, 81213, '<td valign="top">AMAZING! Great work, keep it up. Love the chrome. this speaks to me so much more in B&amp;W then it would in color! 7/10</td>', 'AMAZING! Great work, keep it up. Love the chrome. this speaks to me so much more in B&W then it would in color! 7/10', '2009-09-16 22:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650666, 820837, 83313, '<td valign="top">Overall a good shot, but some elements seem a little off to me. The lower tier of the pagoda seems very soft, while the tiers above it appear much sharper at about the same distance. A visual illusion, perhaps.</td>', 'Overall a good shot, but some elements seem a little off to me. The lower tier of the pagoda seems very soft, while the tiers above it appear much sharper at about the same distance. A visual illusion, perhaps.', '2009-09-16 22:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650667, 820575, 81213, '<td valign="top">Intersting composition...</td>', 'Intersting composition...', '2009-09-16 22:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650671, 820771, 81213, '<td valign="top">Love the Graffiti!!! That just makes the photo for me. Nice sky as well. Good HDR, Im glad the graffiti was so close up. it wouldn''t have the same effect at a distance. 7/10</td>', 'Love the Graffiti!!! That just makes the photo for me. Nice sky as well. Good HDR, Im glad the graffiti was so close up. it wouldn''t have the same effect at a distance. 7/10', '2009-09-16 22:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650673, 821063, 81213, '<td valign="top">Where is this? I need to go there! Amazing waterfall, great find btw. Water is beautiful and I love looking at the depth right below where the falls hit the surface o the water! I would''ve cropped the sides in so all you saw was the waterfall to the rock. would''ve made you 7/10 and 8/10</td>', 'Where is this? I need to go there! Amazing waterfall, great find btw. Water is beautiful and I love looking at the depth right below where the falls hit the surface o the water! I would''ve cropped the sides in so all you saw was the waterfall to the rock. would''ve made you 7/10 and 8/10', '2009-09-16 22:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650675, 820760, 81213, '<td valign="top">Once again... There is no subject in this photo. Beautiful colors, amazing sunsets, one of the best Ive ever seen in photograph form, but what am I looking at exactly. You get a 6 cuz I love the sky so much!!! :)</td>', 'Once again... There is no subject in this photo. Beautiful colors, amazing sunsets, one of the best Ive ever seen in photograph form, but what am I looking at exactly. You get a 6 cuz I love the sky so much!!! :)', '2009-09-16 22:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650679, 821101, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s good, but perhaps the tonemapping in this scene is taken just a little too far for me. Not sure. On the other hand, it did some wonderful things for the clouds. Perhaps some of it is the strong yellow component in the foliage. I tend to turn down the yellow in foliage for a more green look.</td>', 'It''s good, but perhaps the tonemapping in this scene is taken just a little too far for me. Not sure. On the other hand, it did some wonderful things for the clouds. Perhaps some of it is the strong yellow component in the foliage. I tend to turn down the yellow in foliage for a more green look.', '2009-09-16 22:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650680, 820988, 81213, '<td valign="top">Great colors and HDR. One of the best in the challenge... 7/10</td>', 'Great colors and HDR. One of the best in the challenge... 7/10', '2009-09-16 22:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650681, 820959, 83313, '<td valign="top">The b/w was an excellent choice for this. A fave.</td>', 'The b/w was an excellent choice for this. A fave.', '2009-09-16 22:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650683, 821090, 81213, '<td valign="top">Flower is a bit blurry. That takes your score down to a 5. Nice colors and offset. Beautiful flowers. I''d just kill to see the textures on the stem.</td>', 'Flower is a bit blurry. That takes your score down to a 5. Nice colors and offset. Beautiful flowers. I''d just kill to see the textures on the stem.', '2009-09-16 23:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
