(5650887, 820465, 60698, '<td valign="top">Love it! Making it a fav!</td>', 'Love it! Making it a fav!', '2009-09-17 00:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650896, 820374, 99981, '<td valign="top">The background is kind of distracting for me. In my opinion this is not HDR and the flower seems to be OOF. The colors and light are pleasing though.</td>', 'The background is kind of distracting for me. In my opinion this is not HDR and the flower seems to be OOF. The colors and light are pleasing though.', '2009-09-17 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650900, 820951, 99981, '<td valign="top">The bottle is oof and i don''t know if you did that, but looks like the bottle was moved between the captures. The shadows are really distracting too, but i like the B&amp;W and textures. This doesn''t look much HDR for me too. Sorry if i was rude, good luck.</td>', 'The bottle is oof and i don''t know if you did that, but looks like the bottle was moved between the captures. The shadows are really distracting too, but i like the B&W and textures. This doesn''t look much HDR for me too. Sorry if i was rude, good luck.', '2009-09-17 00:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650903, 820908, 99981, '<td valign="top">The harsh light is a little distracting, though the colors are nice so as the perspective. I think the shot could be brighter too, but that was probbably impossible because of the harsh light. The darkness on the trees killed the details, which are a really important things in HDR. Hope you don''t get offended by the comment, good luck.</td>', 'The harsh light is a little distracting, though the colors are nice so as the perspective. I think the shot could be brighter too, but that was probbably impossible because of the harsh light. The darkness on the trees killed the details, which are a really important things in HDR. Hope you don''t get offended by the comment, good luck.', '2009-09-17 00:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650909, 820748, 99981, '<td valign="top">Too snapshot for me. The composition is too busy and the colors are a little dead. I don''t see much HDR either. Maybe a conversion to B&amp;W and more details would be nice. Good luck, sorry for any harsh words.</td>', 'Too snapshot for me. The composition is too busy and the colors are a little dead. I don''t see much HDR either. Maybe a conversion to B&W and more details would be nice. Good luck, sorry for any harsh words.', '2009-09-17 00:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650914, 820732, 99981, '<td valign="top">The saturation is too much in my opinion and nothing seems to be on focus too. The harsh light at the background is distracting too and the image is kind of small. <br/>I''m not experient but i would have used a tripod (if possible), chose a high F/number (or a small aperture) to give more DOF and then processed it trying reduce the white level at the background and make it higher at the foreground, because i think you chosed a nice subject, and the light seemed to be nice on that day. Some nice details on the fore and background would be really nice.</td>', 'The saturation is too much in my opinion and nothing seems to be on focus too. The harsh light at the background is distracting too and the image is kind of small. I''m not experient but i would have used a tripod (if possible), chose a high F/number (or a small aperture) to give more DOF and then processed it trying reduce the white level at the background and make it higher at the foreground, because i think you chosed a nice subject, and the light seemed to be nice on that day. Some nice details on the fore and background would be really nice.', '2009-09-17 00:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650915, 821091, 99981, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much details on this one. Though the colors and light are nice, so as the catch.</td>', 'I don''t see much details on this one. Though the colors and light are nice, so as the catch.', '2009-09-17 00:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650917, 821049, 99981, '<td valign="top">Not much details for me, everything seems dark and the reflections are not really helping the shot. The buildings at the left are not very sharp for me too.</td>', 'Not much details for me, everything seems dark and the reflections are not really helping the shot. The buildings at the left are not very sharp for me too.', '2009-09-17 00:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650919, 821097, 99981, '<td valign="top">This is too overprocessed for my taste. The colors are really great, so as the light, but the details are not the big thing on this shot in my opinion. Good luck for you and sorry if i was rude. If you feel unconfortable with this comment, please sent me a pm and i''ll read your opinion.</td>', 'This is too overprocessed for my taste. The colors are really great, so as the light, but the details are not the big thing on this shot in my opinion. Good luck for you and sorry if i was rude. If you feel unconfortable with this comment, please sent me a pm and i''ll read your opinion.', '2009-09-17 00:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650920, 820829, 99981, '<td valign="top">No much details on this one. The colors are nice and the choice for this object too, but i think you could have more details on this one.</td>', 'No much details on this one. The colors are nice and the choice for this object too, but i think you could have more details on this one.', '2009-09-17 00:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650921, 821071, 99981, '<td valign="top">I love the composition on this one. The colors and light are nice too. The details on the stone are well processed but i wish i could see more details on the shadows and this image is kind of over processed for me. Good luck.</td>', 'I love the composition on this one. The colors and light are nice too. The details on the stone are well processed but i wish i could see more details on the shadows and this image is kind of over processed for me. Good luck.', '2009-09-17 00:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650922, 821103, 99981, '<td valign="top">The foreground is too dark, but the colors and the tones of the sky are great.</td>', 'The foreground is too dark, but the colors and the tones of the sky are great.', '2009-09-17 00:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650924, 820592, 99981, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors on this shot but the light is not helping in my opinion. The left pedal and the white middle part of the bike are too bright and taking too much of my attention. There are dark parts and this gave a weird contrast in my opinion. But i think you did a good job at the composition at all. Good luck and sorry if i was rude.</td>', 'I really like the colors on this shot but the light is not helping in my opinion. The left pedal and the white middle part of the bike are too bright and taking too much of my attention. There are dark parts and this gave a weird contrast in my opinion. But i think you did a good job at the composition at all. Good luck and sorry if i was rude.', '2009-09-17 00:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650932, 820620, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the sharpness at the background and the pp on the bird and foreground. I love the details on the foreground, the colors and light though.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the sharpness at the background and the pp on the bird and foreground. I love the details on the foreground, the colors and light though.', '2009-09-17 00:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650933, 821094, 99981, '<td valign="top">The colors are too warm for me and it''s overprocessed for my taste. I like the textures and the perspective adds a lot to the composition, so as the light.</td>', 'The colors are too warm for me and it''s overprocessed for my taste. I like the textures and the perspective adds a lot to the composition, so as the light.', '2009-09-17 00:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650938, 820411, 99981, '<td valign="top">The green looks a little over saturated but the details and textures are nice.</td>', 'The green looks a little over saturated but the details and textures are nice.', '2009-09-17 00:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650942, 819840, 67237, '<td valign="top">This is my pick for the blue. Good luck!</td>', 'This is my pick for the blue. Good luck!', '2009-09-17 00:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650943, 820917, 99981, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the other car is distracting for me, though i like the light. The sky and the front part of the car could be more bright in my opinion and the back would be nice whithout the crop. I like the perspective too.</td>', 'The reflection of the other car is distracting for me, though i like the light. The sky and the front part of the car could be more bright in my opinion and the back would be nice whithout the crop. I like the perspective too.', '2009-09-17 00:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650944, 820849, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of this white glow on the tree and i think it''s a little overprocessed. I really like the details and colors though. The sky is nice too.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of this white glow on the tree and i think it''s a little overprocessed. I really like the details and colors though. The sky is nice too.', '2009-09-17 00:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650946, 821095, 99981, '<td valign="top">Enough opinion already. I need advice. DO SOMETHING ABOUT IT. heheh<br/>Nice exposure and colors, i could be a just a little bit rotated to the right and the sky looks a little grainy in my monitor. Nice shot.</td>', 'Enough opinion already. I need advice. DO SOMETHING ABOUT IT. hehehNice exposure and colors, i could be a just a little bit rotated to the right and the sky looks a little grainy in my monitor. Nice shot.', '2009-09-17 00:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650947, 820837, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the sky, the colors and the details are nice too, but i wish the temple and the trees were more bright.</td>', 'I like the sky, the colors and the details are nice too, but i wish the temple and the trees were more bright.', '2009-09-17 00:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650953, 821093, 72859, '<td valign="top">4</td>', '4', '2009-09-17 00:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650957, 820904, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m revewing my votes and i''m changing mine on this shot. I think the firs time i looked i was a little harsh because i''m not a fan of the background, the details on the dog are not helping there, and some parts look a little noise in my monitor there too. But i''m really happy to see this details on his face, mostly the eyes. You did a nice job there and i would prefer the shot whithout the puppy, with the dog starring at the camera sitting on a white space.</td>', 'I''m revewing my votes and i''m changing mine on this shot. I think the firs time i looked i was a little harsh because i''m not a fan of the background, the details on the dog are not helping there, and some parts look a little noise in my monitor there too. But i''m really happy to see this details on his face, mostly the eyes. You did a nice job there and i would prefer the shot whithout the puppy, with the dog starring at the camera sitting on a white space.', '2009-09-17 00:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650958, 820734, 99981, '<td valign="top">The sky is great but a selection tool to keep the sky like that and make the foreground look brighter would be nice in my opinion.</td>', 'The sky is great but a selection tool to keep the sky like that and make the foreground look brighter would be nice in my opinion.', '2009-09-17 00:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650963, 820896, 99981, '<td valign="top">A little too busy for me. Though the textures, colors and details are really nice! I would keep the saturation on the reds a little lower.</td>', 'A little too busy for me. Though the textures, colors and details are really nice! I would keep the saturation on the reds a little lower.', '2009-09-17 00:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650964, 820692, 99981, '<td valign="top">This shot would be really amazing with more light at the foreground! Nice capture.</td>', 'This shot would be really amazing with more light at the foreground! Nice capture.', '2009-09-17 00:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5650967, 821040, 72859, '<td valign="top">4</td>', '4', '2009-09-17 00:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
