(5651460, 821091, 109953, '<td valign="top">Cool 5</td>', 'Cool 5', '2009-09-17 15:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651502, 821063, 83313, '<td valign="top">A decent use of the techniques, but somehow falls short of making me say wow. Not sure exactly why. Perhaps overall colors don''t jump out, perhaps composition. Not really sure here.</td>', 'A decent use of the techniques, but somehow falls short of making me say wow. Not sure exactly why. Perhaps overall colors don''t jump out, perhaps composition. Not really sure here.', '2009-09-17 16:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651505, 820860, 83313, '<td valign="top">Title really fits well. I recall when I was a little kid, my grandparents stayed summers at a place that had these kind of metal chairs. Oh, and any idea why is there a refrigerator in the shrubs?</td>', 'Title really fits well. I recall when I was a little kid, my grandparents stayed summers at a place that had these kind of metal chairs. Oh, and any idea why is there a refrigerator in the shrubs?', '2009-09-17 16:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651508, 821096, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like the usage of the technique here. My outtake was a building in an area heavily shaded like this. I have tried a number of times now to get a photo I like, where the subject stands out from the surrounding trees, but I can never nail it, even using HDR. Perhaps you can share with me what you did on this one?</td>', 'I really like the usage of the technique here. My outtake was a building in an area heavily shaded like this. I have tried a number of times now to get a photo I like, where the subject stands out from the surrounding trees, but I can never nail it, even using HDR. Perhaps you can share with me what you did on this one?', '2009-09-17 16:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651511, 820779, 83313, '<td valign="top">I will have to try the long exposure waterscape at some time. It always gives such a cool look to a pic.</td>', 'I will have to try the long exposure waterscape at some time. It always gives such a cool look to a pic.', '2009-09-17 16:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651517, 820908, 83313, '<td valign="top">My first impression was that this shot was soft and lacking detail, but looking at it more closely, I see an incredible amount of detail that is just extremely subtle. Even the slight blowout of the sky beyond the forest adds to the feel of this scene.</td>', 'My first impression was that this shot was soft and lacking detail, but looking at it more closely, I see an incredible amount of detail that is just extremely subtle. Even the slight blowout of the sky beyond the forest adds to the feel of this scene.', '2009-09-17 16:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651519, 821066, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts of the yellow lighting on the building with the cool blue of the night.</td>', 'I like the contrasts of the yellow lighting on the building with the cool blue of the night.', '2009-09-17 16:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651524, 820502, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off very soft and grainy, I''m afraid. At 123k, you also had a lot more overhead on the file size. Thought I see no obvious artifacts, using less compression might have helped squeeze a little more clarity out of this scene. (Don''t worry about it. I''m a bit anal when it comes to compression.) I do like the way you caught the reflection of the orange colors on the water.</td>', 'Comes off very soft and grainy, I''m afraid. At 123k, you also had a lot more overhead on the file size. Thought I see no obvious artifacts, using less compression might have helped squeeze a little more clarity out of this scene. (Don''t worry about it. I''m a bit anal when it comes to compression.) I do like the way you caught the reflection of the orange colors on the water.', '2009-09-17 16:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651530, 821005, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is one of the shots that has been taken to an HDR extreme that should be held up as an example to the others. Certainly over the top, but also very well done, without detail being obscured by the techniques used. Hope you left some notes about how you processed it.</td>', 'This is one of the shots that has been taken to an HDR extreme that should be held up as an example to the others. Certainly over the top, but also very well done, without detail being obscured by the techniques used. Hope you left some notes about how you processed it.', '2009-09-17 16:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651532, 820323, 83313, '<td valign="top">A pleasing natural look use of the techniques. Looks like a great place to explore.</td>', 'A pleasing natural look use of the techniques. Looks like a great place to explore.', '2009-09-17 16:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651535, 820896, 83313, '<td valign="top">The stereotypical HDR look certainly suits the subject. Were you out shopping for items to furnish your kitschen?</td>', 'The stereotypical HDR look certainly suits the subject. Were you out shopping for items to furnish your kitschen?', '2009-09-17 16:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651537, 820716, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice overall seascape. Not making me say wow, but pleasing and still worthy of a positive vote.</td>', 'A nice overall seascape. Not making me say wow, but pleasing and still worthy of a positive vote.', '2009-09-17 16:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651539, 819788, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition, and I like the approach, but it also comes off tome very grainy and pixellated, especially from the bicycle on downward.</td>', 'An interesting composition, and I like the approach, but it also comes off tome very grainy and pixellated, especially from the bicycle on downward.', '2009-09-17 16:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651541, 820988, 83313, '<td valign="top">The sky looks good. I get 10% commission of your votes as payment for my pre-challenge feedback. (I''m skipping the vote on this one, natch.)<br/> <br/>Added: Just passing through while voting. Don''t mind me...</td>', 'The sky looks good. I get 10% commission of your votes as payment for my pre-challenge feedback. (I''m skipping the vote on this one, natch.) Added: Just passing through while voting. Don''t mind me...', '2009-09-17 16:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651543, 820923, 83313, '<td valign="top">I expect to see this one toward the top. The fog rising off the lake adds that extra kick.</td>', 'I expect to see this one toward the top. The fog rising off the lake adds that extra kick.', '2009-09-17 16:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651548, 821040, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit on the dim side, but otherwise I like this. The treatment really does a lot for the variety of details and textures in the scene. I might have cropped out a little more of that sky. For me, the extra sky does not really add anyting to the scene.</td>', 'Seems a bit on the dim side, but otherwise I like this. The treatment really does a lot for the variety of details and textures in the scene. I might have cropped out a little more of that sky. For me, the extra sky does not really add anyting to the scene.', '2009-09-17 16:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651550, 820486, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m off sick today, so I am at least making use of the time to get this challenge voted and commented on. Hope I am not making anyone sick by coughing up on their entries.<br/> <br/>A good enough nighttime cityscape, but not really doing much for me. the yellows look kind of greensish, and perhaps that is dulling the visual impact for me.</td>', 'I''m off sick today, so I am at least making use of the time to get this challenge voted and commented on. Hope I am not making anyone sick by coughing up on their entries. A good enough nighttime cityscape, but not really doing much for me. the yellows look kind of greensish, and perhaps that is dulling the visual impact for me.', '2009-09-17 16:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651552, 820734, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the cool looking storm clouds, though the suburban sprawl in the lower part of the image does not do much for me.</td>', 'I like the cool looking storm clouds, though the suburban sprawl in the lower part of the image does not do much for me.', '2009-09-17 16:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651555, 820735, 83313, '<td valign="top">A totally engaging combination of shallow DOF, HDR techniques, and the way you caught the light on the subject. I''m not normally a floral fan, and this is a common subject, but exceptionally well done. I think I am faving it.</td>', 'A totally engaging combination of shallow DOF, HDR techniques, and the way you caught the light on the subject. I''m not normally a floral fan, and this is a common subject, but exceptionally well done. I think I am faving it.', '2009-09-17 16:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651556, 820971, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is it a pond, or a flooded backyard? I guess the presence of that duck family (almost missed them) says it is indeed as advertised.</td>', 'Is it a pond, or a flooded backyard? I guess the presence of that duck family (almost missed them) says it is indeed as advertised.', '2009-09-17 16:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651559, 820171, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a great location. Does not appear to be HDR at first look, but I am also learning that HDR is a great tool for overcoming the problems inherent in midday sun photography.</td>', 'What a great location. Does not appear to be HDR at first look, but I am also learning that HDR is a great tool for overcoming the problems inherent in midday sun photography.', '2009-09-17 16:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651592, 820900, 29490, '<td valign="top">Two things from me:<br/>- The pier isn''t square to the camera, the tilt makes me dizzy<br/>- The bright patch in the clouds is distracting.<br/> <br/>The composition is very nice but a different time of day and squared camera would have gone gang-busters for me.</td>', 'Two things from me:- The pier isn''t square to the camera, the tilt makes me dizzy- The bright patch in the clouds is distracting. The composition is very nice but a different time of day and squared camera would have gone gang-busters for me.', '2009-09-17 17:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651602, 820891, 29490, '<td valign="top">The center walkway isn''t perpendicular to the camera giving the composition an asymmetrical feel when the composition begs for symmetry.  I like the location.  Brights seem too bright. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The center walkway isn''t perpendicular to the camera giving the composition an asymmetrical feel when the composition begs for symmetry.  I like the location.  Brights seem too bright. Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-09-17 17:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651603, 820904, 109012, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo - I love the blue eye.</td>', 'Interesting photo - I love the blue eye.', '2009-09-17 17:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651604, 820923, 109012, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections and colors - I like how the colors are kind of muted - not too harsh.  The colors on the rocks are cool too.</td>', 'Nice reflections and colors - I like how the colors are kind of muted - not too harsh.  The colors on the rocks are cool too.', '2009-09-17 17:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651606, 820983, 109012, '<td valign="top">Great detail and colors</td>', 'Great detail and colors', '2009-09-17 17:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651607, 820465, 29490, '<td valign="top">Great composition!<br/> <br/>I feel there needs to be more contrast in the shot, the washed-out darks make the brown horse too unrealistic.</td>', 'Great composition! I feel there needs to be more contrast in the shot, the washed-out darks make the brown horse too unrealistic.', '2009-09-17 17:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651627, 820513, 83313, '<td valign="top">The treatment on the petals almost makes them look like they are made of paper.</td>', 'The treatment on the petals almost makes them look like they are made of paper.', '2009-09-17 17:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651632, 820977, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the action in this scene, but I am not sure if it was a good choice for the treatment. It gives a strong orangey look to that first horse. Perhaps selectively turning down the reds in some areas of the photo would help it for me. There is also some visible tilt that I think is also an issue.</td>', 'I like the action in this scene, but I am not sure if it was a good choice for the treatment. It gives a strong orangey look to that first horse. Perhaps selectively turning down the reds in some areas of the photo would help it for me. There is also some visible tilt that I think is also an issue.', '2009-09-17 17:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651637, 820922, 83313, '<td valign="top">I am seeing some serious artifacting and pixellation in the image and I don''t know what is causing it. Your 193k file size does not suggest JPEG compression as the cause. Perhaps it was the processing, or resizing. I have also seen cases where an image was saved and opened as a JPEG a number of times during the course of working on it, and lost some clarity upon each save/open cycle. I''m afraid I have to give this a 4, as something that shows some genuine effort and knowledge, but also has some major problems.</td>', 'I am seeing some serious artifacting and pixellation in the image and I don''t know what is causing it. Your 193k file size does not suggest JPEG compression as the cause. Perhaps it was the processing, or resizing. I have also seen cases where an image was saved and opened as a JPEG a number of times during the course of working on it, and lost some clarity upon each save/open cycle. I''m afraid I have to give this a 4, as something that shows some genuine effort and knowledge, but also has some major problems.', '2009-09-17 17:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651670, 820465, 60910, '<td valign="top">ha!  one of my favs. in this contest!!  i would love for this to win or place top ten!</td>', 'ha!  one of my favs. in this contest!!  i would love for this to win or place top ten!', '2009-09-17 18:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5651676, 821041, 83313, '<td valign="top">Tells a story, though the man in the scene does not appear to be a vagrant as the rest of the scene and the title suggests.</td>', 'Tells a story, though the man in the scene does not appear to be a vagrant as the rest of the scene and the title suggests.', '2009-09-17 18:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
