(5652054, 820988, 109012, '<td valign="top">I like how the skater seems to be flying at me.  Great details.</td>', 'I like how the skater seems to be flying at me.  Great details.', '2009-09-17 23:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652055, 820455, 109012, '<td valign="top">Wow - he really blends in.  Makes me feel like I am right there.</td>', 'Wow - he really blends in.  Makes me feel like I am right there.', '2009-09-17 23:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652057, 820906, 109012, '<td valign="top">nice detail, I like the muted colors.</td>', 'nice detail, I like the muted colors.', '2009-09-17 23:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652058, 820672, 109012, '<td valign="top">This has great depth</td>', 'This has great depth', '2009-09-17 23:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652059, 821003, 109012, '<td valign="top">Wow - love the colors and intensity</td>', 'Wow - love the colors and intensity', '2009-09-17 23:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652060, 821040, 109012, '<td valign="top">Feels old school to me - I like it.  I like how the signs glow.</td>', 'Feels old school to me - I like it.  I like how the signs glow.', '2009-09-17 23:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652062, 820717, 109012, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and depth</td>', 'Nice lines and depth', '2009-09-17 23:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652064, 821066, 109012, '<td valign="top">I like how the hotel looks like it is glowing.  Nice reflections.</td>', 'I like how the hotel looks like it is glowing.  Nice reflections.', '2009-09-17 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652066, 820716, 109012, '<td valign="top">beautiful - nice reflections</td>', 'beautiful - nice reflections', '2009-09-17 23:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652067, 821094, 109012, '<td valign="top">Very cool colors and details, I feel like I am peeking through the window.</td>', 'Very cool colors and details, I feel like I am peeking through the window.', '2009-09-17 23:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652087, 820858, 83313, '<td valign="top">I almost expect to see the Terminator in this scene. Pretty good and appropriate processing of the scene.</td>', 'I almost expect to see the Terminator in this scene. Pretty good and appropriate processing of the scene.', '2009-09-17 23:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652088, 820483, 83313, '<td valign="top">HDR seems to be the ticket for dealing with the difficult midday sun.</td>', 'HDR seems to be the ticket for dealing with the difficult midday sun.', '2009-09-17 23:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652089, 820610, 83313, '<td valign="top">The processing just brought out every vein in those petals.</td>', 'The processing just brought out every vein in those petals.', '2009-09-17 23:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652090, 820838, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting geometry here. I like the straight on perspective. When I take shots like this, I usually find out later on that it was not as centered as I thought it was.</td>', 'Interesting geometry here. I like the straight on perspective. When I take shots like this, I usually find out later on that it was not as centered as I thought it was.', '2009-09-17 23:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652093, 820919, 83313, '<td valign="top">A really neat looking location. The processing brought out a lot of detail. Maybe a little too much for me. Not sure. It''s good, but could be better somehow. Wish I could be more specific.</td>', 'A really neat looking location. The processing brought out a lot of detail. Maybe a little too much for me. Not sure. It''s good, but could be better somehow. Wish I could be more specific.', '2009-09-18 00:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652094, 821006, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and a good use of the treatment.</td>', 'Nice perspective and a good use of the treatment.', '2009-09-18 00:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652096, 820951, 83313, '<td valign="top">Does not have an obvious HDR appearance, though I am certain you did use such techniques. More importantly, though a good product shot, it just does not have anything about it that engages my interest. Seems like the bubbles should, but they don''t. Contrast perhaps?</td>', 'Does not have an obvious HDR appearance, though I am certain you did use such techniques. More importantly, though a good product shot, it just does not have anything about it that engages my interest. Seems like the bubbles should, but they don''t. Contrast perhaps?', '2009-09-18 00:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652097, 820530, 64446, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and clean blue sky coordinating with the bike''s. I think the crop is too tight at the bottom.</td>', 'I like the angle and clean blue sky coordinating with the bike''s. I think the crop is too tight at the bottom.', '2009-09-18 00:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652098, 820610, 64446, '<td valign="top">Great colors and textures!</td>', 'Great colors and textures!', '2009-09-18 00:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652099, 820965, 83313, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the power tower in the background. I think you could have cloned that out under advanced rules and it would have been ok. Maybe a view with more of the bridge in it might have been nice to see.</td>', 'Too bad about the power tower in the background. I think you could have cloned that out under advanced rules and it would have been ok. Maybe a view with more of the bridge in it might have been nice to see.', '2009-09-18 00:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652101, 820907, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice details on this gal, and grabby greens in the back.</td>', 'Nice details on this gal, and grabby greens in the back.', '2009-09-18 00:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652102, 820944, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the low perspective on the scene, but not sure about the overall composition. Seems a little washed out in places. (Not referring to the road.) What I see is the trees and some of the details on the front loader seem a bit odd.</td>', 'I like the low perspective on the scene, but not sure about the overall composition. Seems a little washed out in places. (Not referring to the road.) What I see is the trees and some of the details on the front loader seem a bit odd.', '2009-09-18 00:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652103, 820795, 83313, '<td valign="top">Clearly not multiple exposures, but also clearly done with HDR techniques. I like it.</td>', 'Clearly not multiple exposures, but also clearly done with HDR techniques. I like it.', '2009-09-18 00:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652105, 820923, 64446, '<td valign="top">If the reflection wasn''t enough, it''s a very nice touch that of an already beautiful scenary. This would work great as "deep dof" too. Thanks for sharing... (upgrading)</td>', 'If the reflection wasn''t enough, it''s a very nice touch that of an already beautiful scenary. This would work great as "deep dof" too. Thanks for sharing... (upgrading)', '2009-09-18 00:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652106, 820791, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like an old piece of artwork, except for the contrasting element of the modern windmill.</td>', 'Looks like an old piece of artwork, except for the contrasting element of the modern windmill.', '2009-09-18 00:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652108, 820794, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off to me as a bit overdone on the tonemapping. The bird does not really stand out from the busy background for me.</td>', 'Comes off to me as a bit overdone on the tonemapping. The bird does not really stand out from the busy background for me.', '2009-09-18 00:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652112, 821078, 80859, '<td valign="top">absolutely stunning.... 10</td>', 'absolutely stunning.... 10', '2009-09-18 00:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652114, 821053, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is this high-key or low-key? It''s got nice elements of both. Why do we try to pigeonhole these things?</td>', 'Is this high-key or low-key? It''s got nice elements of both. Why do we try to pigeonhole these things?', '2009-09-18 00:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652115, 821048, 83313, '<td valign="top">Brick walls respond well to HDR. Not a unique subject but well done, nonetheless.</td>', 'Brick walls respond well to HDR. Not a unique subject but well done, nonetheless.', '2009-09-18 00:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652116, 820904, 83313, '<td valign="top">Awwwww! So cute. Is the title the dogs name? I think I might hurt myself if I try to pronounce it.</td>', 'Awwwww! So cute. Is the title the dogs name? I think I might hurt myself if I try to pronounce it.', '2009-09-18 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652119, 820857, 83313, '<td valign="top">This scene, tells me about a drifter, exploring the countryside on his/her motorcycle. Getting into a new adventure each week, with every new town visited. Sounds like a standard formula TV series, doesn''t it?</td>', 'This scene, tells me about a drifter, exploring the countryside on his/her motorcycle. Getting into a new adventure each week, with every new town visited. Sounds like a standard formula TV series, doesn''t it?', '2009-09-18 00:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652120, 821071, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Like this comment.</td>', 'Simple and effective. Like this comment.', '2009-09-18 00:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652123, 820917, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool truck. I have a question, though. How to you actually get up into these things? Gotta have good knees, I presume.</td>', 'Cool truck. I have a question, though. How to you actually get up into these things? Gotta have good knees, I presume.', '2009-09-18 00:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652128, 820988, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice example of HDR of a single image... Love the stopped motion and the details .</td>', 'Nice example of HDR of a single image... Love the stopped motion and the details .', '2009-09-18 00:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652129, 820679, 83313, '<td valign="top">Another day ends on the planet Dumak. Once the beautiful, but dangerous sun is gone from the sky, then the inhabitants come out of the water to forage for lichens and aquatic grasses. Unfortunately, they will find none in this locale, as the harsh radioactive summer has scorched the rocks barren. It is a hard life.</td>', 'Another day ends on the planet Dumak. Once the beautiful, but dangerous sun is gone from the sky, then the inhabitants come out of the water to forage for lichens and aquatic grasses. Unfortunately, they will find none in this locale, as the harsh radioactive summer has scorched the rocks barren. It is a hard life.', '2009-09-18 00:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652131, 821097, 19936, '<td valign="top">Came back for comments:<br/> <br/>Some may mark this down due to halos but I think it is exactly what HDR is all about.  10</td>', 'Came back for comments: Some may mark this down due to halos but I think it is exactly what HDR is all about.  10', '2009-09-18 00:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652132, 821040, 19936, '<td valign="top">Back for comments:<br/>Very cool!  10</td>', 'Back for comments:Very cool!  10', '2009-09-18 00:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652133, 820771, 19936, '<td valign="top">Back for comments:<br/> <br/>Great image and great job with HDR.  A 10 from me.</td>', 'Back for comments: Great image and great job with HDR.  A 10 from me.', '2009-09-18 00:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652134, 820795, 19936, '<td valign="top">Back for comments:<br/> <br/>Great capture and processing!  One of my five 10''s.</td>', 'Back for comments: Great capture and processing!  One of my five 10''s.', '2009-09-18 00:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652135, 820620, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see some major effort here, but I feel the shot is seriously overdone. The water has crisp details, but the bird''s body is soft looking. It seems out of place. There is also a heavily visible tilt to this that is easy to fix.</td>', 'I see some major effort here, but I feel the shot is seriously overdone. The water has crisp details, but the bird''s body is soft looking. It seems out of place. There is also a heavily visible tilt to this that is easy to fix.', '2009-09-18 00:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652136, 820465, 80859, '<td valign="top">love the composition and perspective</td>', 'love the composition and perspective', '2009-09-18 00:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652143, 820849, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hi Tammy. I saved this one for last, because I was skipping the vote, but I wanted to do a 100% comment. So, here goes. I think the processing here was overdone quite a bit. It looks like it was just cranked up with Topaz. (Please see my Flickr stream for some experiments of mine that did not work) I also know this is probably your first effort with HDR techniques. I would love to see the out of the camera shot, maybe even the RAW, and perhaps see what else we can do with it. If you are still talking to me after this comment.</td>', 'Hi Tammy. I saved this one for last, because I was skipping the vote, but I wanted to do a 100% comment. So, here goes. I think the processing here was overdone quite a bit. It looks like it was just cranked up with Topaz. (Please see my Flickr stream for some experiments of mine that did not work) I also know this is probably your first effort with HDR techniques. I would love to see the out of the camera shot, maybe even the RAW, and perhaps see what else we can do with it. If you are still talking to me after this comment.', '2009-09-18 00:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652161, 820889, 80859, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  very pleasing view and clean lines</td>', 'nice composition.  very pleasing view and clean lines', '2009-09-18 01:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652202, 821095, 64446, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Like the simmetry. Nice lighting of the main small central building, contrasting with the clock building and the whole image.</td>', 'Great shot. Like the simmetry. Nice lighting of the main small central building, contrasting with the clock building and the whole image.', '2009-09-18 02:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652203, 820891, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice peaceful place. Somehow, it brings to memory some places from my childhood. Thanks for that too...</td>', 'Nice peaceful place. Somehow, it brings to memory some places from my childhood. Thanks for that too...', '2009-09-18 02:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652204, 820483, 70000, '<td valign="top">Well done! It sits nicely between being too subtle and too over the top. Lovely colors</td>', 'Well done! It sits nicely between being too subtle and too over the top. Lovely colors', '2009-09-18 02:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652206, 820716, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, maybe too rosy on the boats, but I like the 3 posts and their reflections, as they add an interesting touch to the image.</td>', 'Nice sunset, maybe too rosy on the boats, but I like the 3 posts and their reflections, as they add an interesting touch to the image.', '2009-09-18 02:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652208, 820923, 70000, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. The HDR processing has given it an ethereal look without making it so garish as many of the other photos in this challenge. Incredible!</td>', 'Very nicely done. The HDR processing has given it an ethereal look without making it so garish as many of the other photos in this challenge. Incredible!', '2009-09-18 02:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652209, 820806, 64446, '<td valign="top">Rustic and nice details.</td>', 'Rustic and nice details.', '2009-09-18 02:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652210, 821066, 64446, '<td valign="top">The tree is a nice component in this image, but maybe I''d crop the bridge on the left out... Upgrading score.</td>', 'The tree is a nice component in this image, but maybe I''d crop the bridge on the left out... Upgrading score.', '2009-09-18 02:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652212, 820945, 64446, '<td valign="top">Got a nice sky but the foreground is somewhat poor. Maybe cropping all the yellow grass would have a bigger impact.</td>', 'Got a nice sky but the foreground is somewhat poor. Maybe cropping all the yellow grass would have a bigger impact.', '2009-09-18 02:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652218, 820518, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and colours, but there is too much border competing with the image, and stealing the attetion.</td>', 'Nice perspective and colours, but there is too much border competing with the image, and stealing the attetion.', '2009-09-18 02:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652219, 821012, 64446, '<td valign="top">Other than imaging what those folks are doing, there many distractions here: the bag hanging on the tree is a no-no. the foreground is not pretty and steals from the beauty of the mountains at the back and the sky.</td>', 'Other than imaging what those folks are doing, there many distractions here: the bag hanging on the tree is a no-no. the foreground is not pretty and steals from the beauty of the mountains at the back and the sky.', '2009-09-18 02:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652221, 820995, 64446, '<td valign="top">It seems this monster is going to colapse...</td>', 'It seems this monster is going to colapse...', '2009-09-18 02:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652223, 820844, 64446, '<td valign="top">Common but nice perspective. Like the B&amp;W and details on bricks and design.</td>', 'Common but nice perspective. Like the B&W and details on bricks and design.', '2009-09-18 03:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652232, 821063, 64446, '<td valign="top">Very interesting hues and layers...</td>', 'Very interesting hues and layers...', '2009-09-18 03:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652233, 821078, 64446, '<td valign="top">A powerful view. Love the details of the rocks!</td>', 'A powerful view. Love the details of the rocks!', '2009-09-18 03:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652234, 820932, 66616, '<td valign="top">nice, perhaps you should have cropped some off the foreground.</td>', 'nice, perhaps you should have cropped some off the foreground.', '2009-09-18 03:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652235, 820425, 64446, '<td valign="top">The image looks like a drawing for thos sales brochures. Very well done!</td>', 'The image looks like a drawing for thos sales brochures. Very well done!', '2009-09-18 03:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652236, 820987, 66616, '<td valign="top">excellent!</td>', 'excellent!', '2009-09-18 03:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652237, 820781, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. Simle and effective.</td>', 'Nice concept. Simle and effective.', '2009-09-18 03:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652327, 820960, 80908, '<td valign="top">Nice flower but the composition is not inspiring. Perhaps try shooting at an angle or closer up? Also needs more contrast and pop.</td>', 'Nice flower but the composition is not inspiring. Perhaps try shooting at an angle or closer up? Also needs more contrast and pop.', '2009-09-18 05:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652328, 821094, 80908, '<td valign="top">ANOTHER one? Surely you must be bored of this place by now? ;o) (If not NikonJeb then I apologise - carry on shooting!)<br/> <br/>Nice glow effect though.</td>', 'ANOTHER one? Surely you must be bored of this place by now? ;o) (If not NikonJeb then I apologise - carry on shooting!) Nice glow effect though.', '2009-09-18 05:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652331, 821103, 80908, '<td valign="top">A little dark, and ''halfy/halfy''. Needs a subject.</td>', 'A little dark, and ''halfy/halfy''. Needs a subject.', '2009-09-18 05:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652333, 820373, 80908, '<td valign="top">This would have scored a lot higher for me if we had the front of the car in the photo. Sorry to be predictable! Great BW conversion.</td>', 'This would have scored a lot higher for me if we had the front of the car in the photo. Sorry to be predictable! Great BW conversion.', '2009-09-18 06:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652334, 820631, 80908, '<td valign="top">Motion HDR? Ambitious!</td>', 'Motion HDR? Ambitious!', '2009-09-18 06:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652335, 821040, 80908, '<td valign="top">This should be a really boring scene, but somehow you have filled it with promise. Congratulations!</td>', 'This should be a really boring scene, but somehow you have filled it with promise. Congratulations!', '2009-09-18 06:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652337, 820994, 80908, '<td valign="top">Very brooding. Nice composition and use of HDR to bring out all of the interesting detail.</td>', 'Very brooding. Nice composition and use of HDR to bring out all of the interesting detail.', '2009-09-18 06:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652338, 820941, 80908, '<td valign="top">Great ''glow''!</td>', 'Great ''glow''!', '2009-09-18 06:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652339, 820978, 80908, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I find the ''semi-duotone'' effect with still green grass at the bottom quite distracting.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I find the ''semi-duotone'' effect with still green grass at the bottom quite distracting.', '2009-09-18 06:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652352, 820716, 80908, '<td valign="top">Not sure whether the boats moved or the camera (probably the boats) but stillness is critical with HDR, or very fast motor wind with very fast exposures. Even then...</td>', 'Not sure whether the boats moved or the camera (probably the boats) but stillness is critical with HDR, or very fast motor wind with very fast exposures. Even then...', '2009-09-18 07:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652353, 821036, 80908, '<td valign="top">The ''light at the end of the tunnel'' is a little distracting. Nice clean lines on the rest though.</td>', 'The ''light at the end of the tunnel'' is a little distracting. Nice clean lines on the rest though.', '2009-09-18 07:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652354, 820323, 80908, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light. Would be interested to see the middle original on this one (if multiple).</td>', 'Beautiful light. Would be interested to see the middle original on this one (if multiple).', '2009-09-18 07:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652377, 820791, 64446, '<td valign="top">Yet the mill is not moving. Several parts of the image seem blurry (clouds, corn,... ), which doesn''t work for me in this case.</td>', 'Yet the mill is not moving. Several parts of the image seem blurry (clouds, corn,... ), which doesn''t work for me in this case.', '2009-09-18 08:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652517, 821058, 92847, '<td valign="top">Very good B/W edition.</td>', 'Very good B/W edition.', '2009-09-18 11:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652518, 820483, 92847, '<td valign="top">Great shot, well done!</td>', 'Great shot, well done!', '2009-09-18 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652519, 821044, 92847, '<td valign="top">Perfect subject for HDR. Well done!</td>', 'Perfect subject for HDR. Well done!', '2009-09-18 11:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652521, 820944, 92847, '<td valign="top">Two flat tires... it''s really the end of the road. Good job.</td>', 'Two flat tires... it''s really the end of the road. Good job.', '2009-09-18 11:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652522, 820729, 92847, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!! Great Postcard.</td>', 'Beautiful!! Great Postcard.', '2009-09-18 11:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652523, 820916, 92847, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky.</td>', 'Very nice sky.', '2009-09-18 11:52:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5652524, 820917, 92847, '<td valign="top">Good perspective. Well executed.</td>', 'Good perspective. Well executed.', '2009-09-18 11:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652528, 820951, 92847, '<td valign="top">You did a great volume and focus at this photo, but lacks a little interest.</td>', 'You did a great volume and focus at this photo, but lacks a little interest.', '2009-09-18 11:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652529, 820960, 92847, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but a little more focus would be better.</td>', 'Nice colors, but a little more focus would be better.', '2009-09-18 11:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652530, 820556, 92847, '<td valign="top">Moon is an excellent subject, well done.</td>', 'Moon is an excellent subject, well done.', '2009-09-18 12:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652532, 820732, 92847, '<td valign="top">Nice view, but imo, it''s over saturated and lacks in focus.</td>', 'Nice view, but imo, it''s over saturated and lacks in focus.', '2009-09-18 12:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652534, 820374, 92847, '<td valign="top">beautiful flower, but it''s a little flat for HDR challenge.</td>', 'beautiful flower, but it''s a little flat for HDR challenge.', '2009-09-18 12:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652535, 821063, 92847, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tied crop could give more attraction to the falls.</td>', 'Maybe a tied crop could give more attraction to the falls.', '2009-09-18 12:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652540, 820965, 92847, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery, but lacks in post processing for HDR.</td>', 'Nice scenery, but lacks in post processing for HDR.', '2009-09-18 12:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652544, 820509, 92847, '<td valign="top">Great subject. A little more work in Shadow/Highlight could be better to give more volume to the face.</td>', 'Great subject. A little more work in Shadow/Highlight could be better to give more volume to the face.', '2009-09-18 12:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652546, 821049, 92847, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view.</td>', 'Beautiful view.', '2009-09-18 12:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5652548, 821000, 92847, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2009-09-18 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
