(5653714, 820559, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The sky is a bit oversat for my taste. It''s probably that magenta band that curves up around the top of the structure which distracts me the most.  Some haloes on the brick sides.  Very acute angle to the sun.  Good job of using HDR to show some details in the shadows.  8</td>', 'Great composition.  The sky is a bit oversat for my taste. It''s probably that magenta band that curves up around the top of the structure which distracts me the most.  Some haloes on the brick sides.  Very acute angle to the sun.  Good job of using HDR to show some details in the shadows.  8', '2009-09-19 14:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653717, 820141, 54446, '<td valign="top">Magnificent interior.  Great job with HDR.  the trapezoidal effect of the lens perspective may hold this one back.  I have the feeling you may have been too far to the back of the library.  Although, the vanishing lines effect is nice.  8</td>', 'Magnificent interior.  Great job with HDR.  the trapezoidal effect of the lens perspective may hold this one back.  I have the feeling you may have been too far to the back of the library.  Although, the vanishing lines effect is nice.  8', '2009-09-19 14:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653719, 821066, 54446, '<td valign="top">Cool image.  Subdued, but I love the building lights and colors.  It''s a nice scene.  The tree helps.  The sky takes the image over the surreal line, unfortunately.   I might have corrected the trapezoidal effect of the vertical building lines by adjusting the perspective.  8</td>', 'Cool image.  Subdued, but I love the building lights and colors.  It''s a nice scene.  The tree helps.  The sky takes the image over the surreal line, unfortunately.   I might have corrected the trapezoidal effect of the vertical building lines by adjusting the perspective.  8', '2009-09-19 14:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653721, 820889, 54446, '<td valign="top">Love the art deco feel to this.  Very moody, in a good sense.  I might have added a bit more vibrancy, but the saturation is okay.  8</td>', 'Love the art deco feel to this.  Very moody, in a good sense.  I might have added a bit more vibrancy, but the saturation is okay.  8', '2009-09-19 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
