(5653740, 820959, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like the antique truck presentation.  Has more of a Topaz effects look, rather than HDR, but what do I know.  For me, the sky is a big distraction.   Tornado imminent?  7</td>', 'I like the antique truck presentation.  Has more of a Topaz effects look, rather than HDR, but what do I know.  For me, the sky is a big distraction.   Tornado imminent?  7', '2009-09-19 15:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653742, 820719, 54446, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky, wonderful rocks and surf.  I suppose there was improvement in the black shadows coming from the use of HDR.  I think this one needs a little bit different composition.  8</td>', 'Gorgeous sky, wonderful rocks and surf.  I suppose there was improvement in the black shadows coming from the use of HDR.  I think this one needs a little bit different composition.  8', '2009-09-19 15:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
