(5653759, 820679, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Pretty seascape.  Just a bit of lens barrel distortion (horizon dips in the middle... high on left and right).  You can fix that.  Acute angle to the sun is always going to be a challenge to enhance any details in the shadows.  You''ve done a good job.</td>', 'Good composition.  Pretty seascape.  Just a bit of lens barrel distortion (horizon dips in the middle... high on left and right).  You can fix that.  Acute angle to the sun is always going to be a challenge to enhance any details in the shadows.  You''ve done a good job.', '2009-09-19 15:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653762, 820686, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this image except for the white light big star.  It glares in my eyes while I''m trying to examine detail.  Love your subject.  Great job on the silk water effect.</td>', 'I like everything about this image except for the white light big star.  It glares in my eyes while I''m trying to examine detail.  Love your subject.  Great job on the silk water effect.', '2009-09-19 15:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
