(5653766, 820729, 54446, '<td valign="top">Surreal colors.  The greens are oversaturated.  The sky is a distraction.   Some lens flare (water droplets?).  It''s an interesting image to inspect.  A bit over-processed overall.  7</td>', 'Surreal colors.  The greens are oversaturated.  The sky is a distraction.   Some lens flare (water droplets?).  It''s an interesting image to inspect.  A bit over-processed overall.  7', '2009-09-19 15:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
