(5653848, 820923, 34171, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I gave it an 8.  I would have given it a 9, but the Horizon seems tilted to me.  Could be just the way the mist hangs over the water, but it''s distracting to me.  Nice work none the less.<br/> <br/>Cheers,</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I gave it an 8.  I would have given it a 9, but the Horizon seems tilted to me.  Could be just the way the mist hangs over the water, but it''s distracting to me.  Nice work none the less. Cheers,', '2009-09-19 18:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653900, 820965, 62357, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the pylon against the pretty archway. Sadly the sky is not working so well</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the pylon against the pretty archway. Sadly the sky is not working so well', '2009-09-19 20:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653901, 820171, 62357, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment.  I gave this a 6.  Definitely not over processed, but I can see how some people who have the "must look like a cartoon" view of HDR may score it low.  To be honest, I was hovering between 5 and 6 but that has NOTHING to do with the HDR effect, it''s more the composition of the image that was pushing me towards a 5.  It think this is where people seem to forget (that comment is directed more to what I have read in the forum, not you by the way!), it''s not just about the HDR. I am not a big fan of the black border.  I think it does not enhance this image at all, if you needed a border, I think white would have worked a bit better.<br/> <br/>As far as the processing goes, you definitely managed to pull out some detail by using the HDR technique, but in the process, I think the cyan/blue channel seems to have been tweaked a bit too much as it appears to be somewhat unnatural.  I think the midtones also could do with being toned down a bit, as it seems quite bright.<br/> <br/>Overall, I do think you are suffering because it is not what the viewers here on DPC have come to expect from HDR, but also a little bit because of the compoition and general level processing. As I said, I did give it a six.  I hope this is helpful.</td>', 'Coming back to comment.  I gave this a 6.  Definitely not over processed, but I can see how some people who have the "must look like a cartoon" view of HDR may score it low.  To be honest, I was hovering between 5 and 6 but that has NOTHING to do with the HDR effect, it''s more the composition of the image that was pushing me towards a 5.  It think this is where people seem to forget (that comment is directed more to what I have read in the forum, not you by the way!), it''s not just about the HDR. I am not a big fan of the black border.  I think it does not enhance this image at all, if you needed a border, I think white would have worked a bit better. As far as the processing goes, you definitely managed to pull out some detail by using the HDR technique, but in the process, I think the cyan/blue channel seems to have been tweaked a bit too much as it appears to be somewhat unnatural.  I think the midtones also could do with being toned down a bit, as it seems quite bright. Overall, I do think you are suffering because it is not what the viewers here on DPC have come to expect from HDR, but also a little bit because of the compoition and general level processing. As I said, I did give it a six.  I hope this is helpful.', '2009-09-19 20:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653910, 820530, 62357, '<td valign="top">You have done really well bringing out the details in the bike, but the sky let''s this down.</td>', 'You have done really well bringing out the details in the bike, but the sky let''s this down.', '2009-09-19 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653911, 820900, 62357, '<td valign="top">what a pity the horizon is tilted.</td>', 'what a pity the horizon is tilted.', '2009-09-19 20:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653912, 821036, 62357, '<td valign="top">I think the processing is very nicely done here, lots of details brought out.  Just the subject and composition are not terribly interesting.</td>', 'I think the processing is very nicely done here, lots of details brought out.  Just the subject and composition are not terribly interesting.', '2009-09-19 20:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653913, 820717, 62357, '<td valign="top">The HDR treatment on the buildings works really well, but sadly the sky and the haloing is not good.</td>', 'The HDR treatment on the buildings works really well, but sadly the sky and the haloing is not good.', '2009-09-19 20:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653925, 821025, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great scene.  The reflection of the sky is super.  The sky itself is a distraction because of graininess, off color, uneven gradient and smudgy areas.  Not sure the trees and grasses on the other side of the pond are completely in focus.</td>', 'Great scene.  The reflection of the sky is super.  The sky itself is a distraction because of graininess, off color, uneven gradient and smudgy areas.  Not sure the trees and grasses on the other side of the pond are completely in focus.', '2009-09-19 20:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653927, 821071, 54446, '<td valign="top">Bright light from window and indoor items represent a major challenge.  You''ve done a good job, considering the very large dynamic range of the scene.  The halo areas around the tub are a distraction.  Some blown out highlights in the upper window panes.</td>', 'Bright light from window and indoor items represent a major challenge.  You''ve done a good job, considering the very large dynamic range of the scene.  The halo areas around the tub are a distraction.  Some blown out highlights in the upper window panes.', '2009-09-19 20:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653928, 820963, 54446, '<td valign="top">You may have cropped too closely, clipping the logo and building top edge.  Might have been effective to correct the trapezoidal effect.</td>', 'You may have cropped too closely, clipping the logo and building top edge.  Might have been effective to correct the trapezoidal effect.', '2009-09-19 20:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653929, 820708, 54446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery.  The bright overcast gray sky was not helpful to you.    Considering the weather, this is a good effort.</td>', 'Beautiful scenery.  The bright overcast gray sky was not helpful to you.    Considering the weather, this is a good effort.', '2009-09-19 20:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653930, 820829, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good derelict buidling.  Interesting detail to explore.  The sky is a negative.  I do like the detail enhancement of the shadows.</td>', 'Good derelict buidling.  Interesting detail to explore.  The sky is a negative.  I do like the detail enhancement of the shadows.', '2009-09-19 20:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
