(5653934, 820902, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good demonstration of the capabilities of HDR to enhance details in the shadows.  If this is a redwood, the pink/magenta tone is foreign to me in the foreground tree bark.  The other trees have bark color spot on.  Good sky.  Unique perspective</td>', 'Good demonstration of the capabilities of HDR to enhance details in the shadows.  If this is a redwood, the pink/magenta tone is foreign to me in the foreground tree bark.  The other trees have bark color spot on.  Good sky.  Unique perspective', '2009-09-19 20:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653935, 820989, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good job of enhancing the details in the shadows.</td>', 'Good job of enhancing the details in the shadows.', '2009-09-19 20:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653938, 820837, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Great subject.  I think you are half way there.  The building and trees are somewhat underexposed.  The sky and clouds are overexposed to the point of blown out highlights.  Not sure you accomplished your goal of HDR improvement.</td>', 'Good composition.  Great subject.  I think you are half way there.  The building and trees are somewhat underexposed.  The sky and clouds are overexposed to the point of blown out highlights.  Not sure you accomplished your goal of HDR improvement.', '2009-09-19 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
