(5653941, 821044, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Good example of the ability to bring up detail in the shadows, as we are looking at a bright window with light flowing in.  8</td>', 'I like it.  Good example of the ability to bring up detail in the shadows, as we are looking at a bright window with light flowing in.  8', '2009-09-19 20:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653942, 820857, 108687, '<td valign="top">Love the GS....</td>', 'Love the GS....', '2009-09-19 20:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653944, 820530, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nice bike.  Not sure HDR did anything for you here, but I see the shadows may have been dark in the bright sunlight.  And, you did bring up detail there.  The sky gradient aberrations are a distraction to an otherwise beautiful bike.</td>', 'Nice bike.  Not sure HDR did anything for you here, but I see the shadows may have been dark in the bright sunlight.  And, you did bring up detail there.  The sky gradient aberrations are a distraction to an otherwise beautiful bike.', '2009-09-19 20:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653946, 821101, 54446, '<td valign="top">Just oversaturated a bunch.  Great scene otherwise.  In the sky, there are either dust spots.   Or, if the spots are birds.... then they were not a good choice for an HDR blend.  (Yes, I know there''s more than one way to "meet the challenge".)</td>', 'Just oversaturated a bunch.  Great scene otherwise.  In the sky, there are either dust spots.   Or, if the spots are birds.... then they were not a good choice for an HDR blend.  (Yes, I know there''s more than one way to "meet the challenge".)', '2009-09-19 21:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653947, 821078, 54446, '<td valign="top">Cool subject.  Maybe too much silk water blur.  The sky is not an attribute.  I think you would have benefitted from some dynamic light in the scene, like shows up a little bit in the rocks upper right.  Otherwise, the image seems underexposed overall.</td>', 'Cool subject.  Maybe too much silk water blur.  The sky is not an attribute.  I think you would have benefitted from some dynamic light in the scene, like shows up a little bit in the rocks upper right.  Otherwise, the image seems underexposed overall.', '2009-09-19 21:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653948, 820096, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great t-storm.  Saturation seems to be overdone, without benefit to the caliber of the image.</td>', 'Great t-storm.  Saturation seems to be overdone, without benefit to the caliber of the image.', '2009-09-19 21:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653949, 820694, 54446, '<td valign="top">The acute angle to the sun makes this scene a tremendous challenge to present, even with the help of exposure blending.</td>', 'The acute angle to the sun makes this scene a tremendous challenge to present, even with the help of exposure blending.', '2009-09-19 21:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653950, 820502, 54446, '<td valign="top">Interesting sky.  Might be oversat.  I like the colorful reflections on the water.  The image probably needs another element of interest.  The sailboat out there would have been very useful, if it had been much closer.</td>', 'Interesting sky.  Might be oversat.  I like the colorful reflections on the water.  The image probably needs another element of interest.  The sailboat out there would have been very useful, if it had been much closer.', '2009-09-19 21:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653951, 820908, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good effort.  Unfortunate and distracting to have the sunlight coming in blown out in many areas.  It was a good experiment.  I see some translucent glow, but would have liked to see more of that kind of light.</td>', 'Good effort.  Unfortunate and distracting to have the sunlight coming in blown out in many areas.  It was a good experiment.  I see some translucent glow, but would have liked to see more of that kind of light.', '2009-09-19 21:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653952, 820592, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good effort, but the smudginess in the sky gradient distracts.</td>', 'Good effort, but the smudginess in the sky gradient distracts.', '2009-09-19 21:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653954, 820634, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good use of the HDR technique.  Beyond that, the composition would  have been more interesting by choosing the horizon location above or below the vertical center.  Also, the sun is center-middle.</td>', 'Good use of the HDR technique.  Beyond that, the composition would  have been more interesting by choosing the horizon location above or below the vertical center.  Also, the sun is center-middle.', '2009-09-19 21:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653955, 820631, 54446, '<td valign="top">Odd colors, a smoke grey/brown sky and a lack of sharpness may hold back this image.</td>', 'Odd colors, a smoke grey/brown sky and a lack of sharpness may hold back this image.', '2009-09-19 21:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653956, 820758, 54446, '<td valign="top">Interesting machine.  The sky is a distraction.  Overall, this image is oversaturated.</td>', 'Interesting machine.  The sky is a distraction.  Overall, this image is oversaturated.', '2009-09-19 21:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653957, 820996, 54446, '<td valign="top">It''s not readily apparent how HDR processing helped this image.  The dark overcast sky sems a mismatch to the light in the scene.</td>', 'It''s not readily apparent how HDR processing helped this image.  The dark overcast sky sems a mismatch to the light in the scene.', '2009-09-19 21:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653958, 819840, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  Minor haloes around the lighthouse.  Control of exposure overall very good.  It''s probably the odd sky detail which distracts me from an otherwise fine scene.</td>', 'Excellent composition.  Minor haloes around the lighthouse.  Control of exposure overall very good.  It''s probably the odd sky detail which distracts me from an otherwise fine scene.', '2009-09-19 21:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653959, 821036, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good demonstration of bringing up details in the shadows.  8</td>', 'Good demonstration of bringing up details in the shadows.  8', '2009-09-19 21:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653960, 820575, 54446, '<td valign="top">I like this.   The goldenrod is fine.  The distant tree in the fog is a contrast to the brightness and clarity of the foreground.</td>', 'I like this.   The goldenrod is fine.  The distant tree in the fog is a contrast to the brightness and clarity of the foreground.', '2009-09-19 21:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653961, 821003, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nice owl.  White background?  Clipped wingtips.    Pretty good detail.  Not a great subject for HDR, because birds move a lot, which may explain some fuzzy feather areas.</td>', 'Nice owl.  White background?  Clipped wingtips.    Pretty good detail.  Not a great subject for HDR, because birds move a lot, which may explain some fuzzy feather areas.', '2009-09-19 21:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653962, 820305, 54446, '<td valign="top">Sky is blown out (same color as white frame).  I suspect there may have been an HDR benefit in bringing up the details in the shadows.  Might have been more effective to capture this image in softer light during golden hours.  The frame reduces the viewable portion of the scene.</td>', 'Sky is blown out (same color as white frame).  I suspect there may have been an HDR benefit in bringing up the details in the shadows.  Might have been more effective to capture this image in softer light during golden hours.  The frame reduces the viewable portion of the scene.', '2009-09-19 21:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653964, 820914, 54446, '<td valign="top">Grand scene.   Outstanding crepuscular rays.  However, mostly underexposed and oversaturated.  Acute angle to the sun very difficult to work with.</td>', 'Grand scene.   Outstanding crepuscular rays.  However, mostly underexposed and oversaturated.  Acute angle to the sun very difficult to work with.', '2009-09-19 21:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653967, 820518, 54446, '<td valign="top">A good subject for HDR, but uneven light throughout.</td>', 'A good subject for HDR, but uneven light throughout.', '2009-09-19 21:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653969, 821095, 54446, '<td valign="top">The glaring lights and oversaturation overwhelm.  it''s just too much of a good thing.</td>', 'The glaring lights and oversaturation overwhelm.  it''s just too much of a good thing.', '2009-09-19 21:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653970, 821006, 54446, '<td valign="top">Center middle composition.  Flat light and colors.  An unhelpful sky.  But, at least the image is natural looking.</td>', 'Center middle composition.  Flat light and colors.  An unhelpful sky.  But, at least the image is natural looking.', '2009-09-19 21:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5653994, 820944, 54446, '<td valign="top">A bit "foggy" in the middle (lens flare?).  the front end bucket is clipped to the disadvantage of the image.  The clouds are mighty bright.  Tough angle to the sun.</td>', 'A bit "foggy" in the middle (lens flare?).  the front end bucket is clipped to the disadvantage of the image.  The clouds are mighty bright.  Tough angle to the sun.', '2009-09-19 22:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654000, 820465, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good humor shot!  7</td>', 'Good humor shot!  7', '2009-09-19 22:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654001, 820828, 54446, '<td valign="top">Cute little bull.  I like the subject, but it may not be the best for an HDR image.</td>', 'Cute little bull.  I like the subject, but it may not be the best for an HDR image.', '2009-09-19 22:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654002, 820373, 54446, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you clipped the front end.  Creates an unbalance which is not mitigated by other elements of interest.</td>', 'Not sure why you clipped the front end.  Creates an unbalance which is not mitigated by other elements of interest.', '2009-09-19 22:55:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5654005, 820791, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good looking corn field.  Is this western Iowa where i see all those great wind turbines along I-80?  The image is surreal, but I like your effort.  8</td>', 'Good looking corn field.  Is this western Iowa where i see all those great wind turbines along I-80?  The image is surreal, but I like your effort.  8', '2009-09-19 22:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654007, 820323, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty good.  I don''t think the frame helps, as I''d rather see more of the image.  Not sure HDR gave you a lot of help here.  It is fairly natural looking for a golden hours image.</td>', 'Pretty good.  I don''t think the frame helps, as I''d rather see more of the image.  Not sure HDR gave you a lot of help here.  It is fairly natural looking for a golden hours image.', '2009-09-19 22:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654008, 821012, 54446, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  Well composed.  Just one notch oversat.  The sky uneven gradient is distracting.</td>', 'Interesting image.  Well composed.  Just one notch oversat.  The sky uneven gradient is distracting.', '2009-09-19 22:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654012, 820983, 54446, '<td valign="top">Okay image of this derelict car.  Good colors.  Not sure you got a lot of benefit from HDR nultiple image blend over a single image.</td>', 'Okay image of this derelict car.  Good colors.  Not sure you got a lot of benefit from HDR nultiple image blend over a single image.', '2009-09-19 23:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654013, 821093, 54446, '<td valign="top">Underexposed above.  Oversaturated below.</td>', 'Underexposed above.  Oversaturated below.', '2009-09-19 23:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654015, 821097, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good demo of the HDR potential.  The outcome has a unique and dramatic style.  Not sure I totally like the result, but I like the obvious effort put into the process.  8</td>', 'Good demo of the HDR potential.  The outcome has a unique and dramatic style.  Not sure I totally like the result, but I like the obvious effort put into the process.  8', '2009-09-19 23:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654016, 821053, 54446, '<td valign="top">Sharp details.  Mighty bright.  Detail lost in the highlights and shadows, so I''m not sure you gained from HDR on this one.</td>', 'Sharp details.  Mighty bright.  Detail lost in the highlights and shadows, so I''m not sure you gained from HDR on this one.', '2009-09-19 23:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654018, 821049, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty cityscape lights and colors.  I think you probably did enhance some details in the building shadows.</td>', 'Pretty cityscape lights and colors.  I think you probably did enhance some details in the building shadows.', '2009-09-19 23:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654022, 820834, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good antiques and tree.  Unbalanced composition.... too asymmetrical.  The electrical wires are anachronistic and a distraction.</td>', 'Good antiques and tree.  Unbalanced composition.... too asymmetrical.  The electrical wires are anachronistic and a distraction.', '2009-09-19 23:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654023, 820917, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good detail enhancement in the shadows.  The sky is a distraction.</td>', 'Good detail enhancement in the shadows.  The sky is a distraction.', '2009-09-19 23:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654025, 821043, 54446, '<td valign="top">Moving animals are tough subjects for HDR multiple image blending, if that''s what this is.  Lots of sky, distant meadow and subject farm house.</td>', 'Moving animals are tough subjects for HDR multiple image blending, if that''s what this is.  Lots of sky, distant meadow and subject farm house.', '2009-09-19 23:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654028, 820844, 54446, '<td valign="top">I actually don''t mind the blurred people images.  My focus was instead drawn to the roofline, which shows quite a lot of blur and halo.</td>', 'I actually don''t mind the blurred people images.  My focus was instead drawn to the roofline, which shows quite a lot of blur and halo.', '2009-09-19 23:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654030, 820971, 54446, '<td valign="top">The acute angle to the sun makes this scene almost impossible to manage with HDR.</td>', 'The acute angle to the sun makes this scene almost impossible to manage with HDR.', '2009-09-19 23:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654033, 820878, 54446, '<td valign="top">The sky behind the wonderful tree is an unevenly exposed distraction.  I really like the tree and the setting.</td>', 'The sky behind the wonderful tree is an unevenly exposed distraction.  I really like the tree and the setting.', '2009-09-19 23:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654040, 820590, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky gradient and clouds.  And, I see there is detail enhanced in the sand beach.  It is natural looking and not oversaturated.  Probably needs another element of interest.</td>', 'Wonderful sky gradient and clouds.  And, I see there is detail enhanced in the sand beach.  It is natural looking and not oversaturated.  Probably needs another element of interest.', '2009-09-19 23:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654041, 820058, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great clouds, but probably too much sky, as a proportion of the scene.  The greens are oversaturated.  The scene needs another element of interest, like something in the foreground to create more of a three dimensional look.</td>', 'Great clouds, but probably too much sky, as a proportion of the scene.  The greens are oversaturated.  The scene needs another element of interest, like something in the foreground to create more of a three dimensional look.', '2009-09-19 23:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654042, 820526, 54446, '<td valign="top">Interesting application of HDR technique.</td>', 'Interesting application of HDR technique.', '2009-09-19 23:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654043, 820734, 54446, '<td valign="top">The sky is ominous.  Needs a focal point in the scene, rather than just expecting the viewer to look at the cityscape.</td>', 'The sky is ominous.  Needs a focal point in the scene, rather than just expecting the viewer to look at the cityscape.', '2009-09-19 23:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654044, 820987, 54446, '<td valign="top">Tough angle to the sun.  I like the foreground rock and grasses.  The frame is a negative.</td>', 'Tough angle to the sun.  I like the foreground rock and grasses.  The frame is a negative.', '2009-09-19 23:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654045, 821005, 54446, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the selective desaturation of the sky, or the replacement of the sky.  The scene is unique.  I think a zoom and crop may have helped.</td>', 'I don''t like the selective desaturation of the sky, or the replacement of the sky.  The scene is unique.  I think a zoom and crop may have helped.', '2009-09-19 23:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654048, 820672, 54446, '<td valign="top">I love the street scene.  I hate the sky.   Good enhancement of detail in the shadows.  7</td>', 'I love the street scene.  I hate the sky.   Good enhancement of detail in the shadows.  7', '2009-09-19 23:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654049, 820994, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Good use of foreground elements.  The sky is not a plus.  No detail lost in highlights or shadows.</td>', 'Good composition. Good use of foreground elements.  The sky is not a plus.  No detail lost in highlights or shadows.', '2009-09-19 23:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654050, 820716, 54446, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft here and there.  Not sure why, unless the focus point was placed out too far and the nearby subjects are in front of the DOF plane.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft here and there.  Not sure why, unless the focus point was placed out too far and the nearby subjects are in front of the DOF plane.', '2009-09-19 23:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654051, 820891, 54446, '<td valign="top">I know the light angle is low and warm... late in the day.  I might have worked with the color temp some.... to the cooler side.  Good job of enhancing detail in the shadows.</td>', 'I know the light angle is low and warm... late in the day.  I might have worked with the color temp some.... to the cooler side.  Good job of enhancing detail in the shadows.', '2009-09-19 23:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654052, 820995, 54446, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Might have benefitted from a perspective correction to ease the trapezoidal effect.  The sky is not a positive.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Might have benefitted from a perspective correction to ease the trapezoidal effect.  The sky is not a positive.', '2009-09-19 23:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654053, 820167, 54446, '<td valign="top">A bit heavy on the saturation.</td>', 'A bit heavy on the saturation.', '2009-09-19 23:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654054, 820509, 54446, '<td valign="top">A full frame image of a statue.  Detail lost in shadows.</td>', 'A full frame image of a statue.  Detail lost in shadows.', '2009-09-19 23:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654055, 820171, 54446, '<td valign="top">Not sure this image was a beneficiary of the HDR exposure blending process.</td>', 'Not sure this image was a beneficiary of the HDR exposure blending process.', '2009-09-19 23:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654056, 820410, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good, sharp detail and even exposure.  Unnatural and underexposed sky.</td>', 'Good, sharp detail and even exposure.  Unnatural and underexposed sky.', '2009-09-19 23:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654057, 820206, 54446, '<td valign="top">Nice layering.  I wish the sky was not so grey and dreary.</td>', 'Nice layering.  I wish the sky was not so grey and dreary.', '2009-09-19 23:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654058, 820549, 54446, '<td valign="top">Super macro image.</td>', 'Super macro image.', '2009-09-19 23:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654060, 820036, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very nice flying buttresses and train.  The sky is a distracting negative.</td>', 'Very nice flying buttresses and train.  The sky is a distracting negative.', '2009-09-19 23:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654061, 820964, 54446, '<td valign="top">Sure is a unique style and presentation.</td>', 'Sure is a unique style and presentation.', '2009-09-19 23:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654062, 821000, 54446, '<td valign="top">My first reaction to this image was, "that''s a lot of purple fringing".    The middle glaring light is tough to view.  The lens flare is not an attribute.  However, considering the difficulty of the capture, I''d say this is a noteworthy effort.  7</td>', 'My first reaction to this image was, "that''s a lot of purple fringing".    The middle glaring light is tough to view.  The lens flare is not an attribute.  However, considering the difficulty of the capture, I''d say this is a noteworthy effort.  7', '2009-09-19 23:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654064, 821033, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good layering.  Needs another one or two elements of interest.</td>', 'Good layering.  Needs another one or two elements of interest.', '2009-09-19 23:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654066, 821090, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent still life image.  Good composition.  Not obvious to me how HDR helped this image.</td>', 'Excellent still life image.  Good composition.  Not obvious to me how HDR helped this image.', '2009-09-19 23:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654067, 820735, 54446, '<td valign="top">Cool nature shot.  For this one, in the sunlight, I can see the shadow detail was enhanced.  7</td>', 'Cool nature shot.  For this one, in the sunlight, I can see the shadow detail was enhanced.  7', '2009-09-19 23:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654068, 820781, 54446, '<td valign="top">Unique image and presentation.</td>', 'Unique image and presentation.', '2009-09-19 23:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654070, 820552, 54446, '<td valign="top">In the bright sunshine of midday, I suppose the vehicles traveling through the tunnel were in very black shadow.   I''m sure HDR brought up some shadow detail.  The sky is a natural color.</td>', 'In the bright sunshine of midday, I suppose the vehicles traveling through the tunnel were in very black shadow.   I''m sure HDR brought up some shadow detail.  The sky is a natural color.', '2009-09-19 23:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654073, 820978, 54446, '<td valign="top">sepia, b&amp;w and green grass.  Unusual combination.  Seems overall underexposed, especially where I''d like to see more detail in the building and trees.</td>', 'sepia, b&w and green grass.  Unusual combination.  Seems overall underexposed, especially where I''d like to see more detail in the building and trees.', '2009-09-19 23:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654074, 820904, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very cute dog.</td>', 'Very cute dog.', '2009-09-19 23:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654077, 821096, 54446, '<td valign="top">Actually a good job of bringing up detail in the shadows and containing bright highlights.   The image needs a focal point and another one or two elements of interest.</td>', 'Actually a good job of bringing up detail in the shadows and containing bright highlights.   The image needs a focal point and another one or two elements of interest.', '2009-09-19 23:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654078, 820951, 54446, '<td valign="top">Inconsistent shadows are a distraction.  Not sure this is a good subject for HDR.</td>', 'Inconsistent shadows are a distraction.  Not sure this is a good subject for HDR.', '2009-09-19 23:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654079, 821070, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good tracks.  The rail cars are a bit distant.  Colorful.</td>', 'Good tracks.  The rail cars are a bit distant.  Colorful.', '2009-09-19 23:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654080, 820513, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good experiment.  The vibrancy of the petals was lost somehow.</td>', 'Good experiment.  The vibrancy of the petals was lost somehow.', '2009-09-19 23:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654081, 820965, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good job of enhancing details in the shadows.  The power transmission tower and lines is a major distraction.</td>', 'Good job of enhancing details in the shadows.  The power transmission tower and lines is a major distraction.', '2009-09-19 23:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654082, 820906, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good macro and water droplets.</td>', 'Good macro and water droplets.', '2009-09-19 23:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654083, 820916, 54446, '<td valign="top">Halo on all edges of telephone pole.    The oil pumping rigs might have been more interesting if closer.</td>', 'Halo on all edges of telephone pole.    The oil pumping rigs might have been more interesting if closer.', '2009-09-19 23:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654085, 820692, 54446, '<td valign="top">Almost impossible acute angle to the sun overwhelming the ability of HDR to rescue the detail in the amusement park.</td>', 'Almost impossible acute angle to the sun overwhelming the ability of HDR to rescue the detail in the amusement park.', '2009-09-19 23:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654086, 820962, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty good overall exposure.  Needs more elements of interest.</td>', 'Pretty good overall exposure.  Needs more elements of interest.', '2009-09-19 23:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654087, 820715, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good detail and lighting on building.  The sky is unnatural, therefore not an attribute.</td>', 'Good detail and lighting on building.  The sky is unnatural, therefore not an attribute.', '2009-09-19 23:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654089, 820986, 54446, '<td valign="top">Technically excellent.  Good artistic eye, you have!  7</td>', 'Technically excellent.  Good artistic eye, you have!  7', '2009-09-19 23:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654091, 820919, 54446, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit flat.  This needs another element of interest.</td>', 'The light is a bit flat.  This needs another element of interest.', '2009-09-19 23:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654092, 820343, 54446, '<td valign="top">The eye catchlights are those of a non-live creature, like the glass eyes of a taxidermy project.</td>', 'The eye catchlights are those of a non-live creature, like the glass eyes of a taxidermy project.', '2009-09-19 23:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654093, 821088, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  A lot of negative white space.  Good detail on the tree and bird.</td>', 'Great composition.  A lot of negative white space.  Good detail on the tree and bird.', '2009-09-19 23:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654095, 820556, 54446, '<td valign="top">Not an easy, nor feasible, subject for HDR.</td>', 'Not an easy, nor feasible, subject for HDR.', '2009-09-19 23:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654096, 820795, 54446, '<td valign="top">Not an easy, nor feasible, subject for HDR.</td>', 'Not an easy, nor feasible, subject for HDR.', '2009-09-19 23:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654097, 820894, 54446, '<td valign="top">Underexposed foreground.  Posterized sky.</td>', 'Underexposed foreground.  Posterized sky.', '2009-09-20 00:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5654098, 820620, 54446, '<td valign="top">Moving birds are not an easy, nor feasible, subject for multiple image HDR blending.</td>', 'Moving birds are not an easy, nor feasible, subject for multiple image HDR blending.', '2009-09-20 00:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
