(5654487, 821005, 64446, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting image that tells a story. I like many elements here: the roof, the furnace, the cart,  the fence on left, the hut''s walls, the tire atop the clay shingles pile and, last, what makes it the most: the posing lady, who seems happy despite the humble circunstances. Nice work.<br/>I just don''t like your interpretation and find unfair - and a bit judgemental &amp; depreciative - the title you gave. (Well, I might sound judgemental here too, but that`s a prerrogative I won`t waive... :-) )</td>', 'It''s an interesting image that tells a story. I like many elements here: the roof, the furnace, the cart,  the fence on left, the hut''s walls, the tire atop the clay shingles pile and, last, what makes it the most: the posing lady, who seems happy despite the humble circunstances. Nice work.I just don''t like your interpretation and find unfair - and a bit judgemental & depreciative - the title you gave. (Well, I might sound judgemental here too, but that`s a prerrogative I won`t waive... :-) )', '2009-09-20 14:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
