(5655023, 820960, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and colors. I just think that this image don''t have the details i expect to see in HDR. This close-up of a flower too used in dpchallenge already, but i think you used it in a different way. The shot is artistic for me too. The background looks distracting. Good luck and i''m sorry if i was rude.</td>', 'I like the textures and colors. I just think that this image don''t have the details i expect to see in HDR. This close-up of a flower too used in dpchallenge already, but i think you used it in a different way. The shot is artistic for me too. The background looks distracting. Good luck and i''m sorry if i was rude.', '2009-09-21 00:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655024, 820922, 99981, '<td valign="top">The foreground looks really dark and with a bad sharpness. The quality of the image is kind of poor in my monitor, the colors seems to be a little washed and i don''t see many details on the foreground too. Though, i think you did a nice job with the perspective, because the lake is really well positioned and the DOF is really nice in my opinion, i really like the details on that mountain at the back. There are some black spots at the sky too, hopelly not from your lens. The border is nice too.<br/>I''m not experient but i would try a really overexposed and a really underexposed shots to combine, i think that way you would have nice quality at the shadows (lake) and at the brighter parts.</td>', 'The foreground looks really dark and with a bad sharpness. The quality of the image is kind of poor in my monitor, the colors seems to be a little washed and i don''t see many details on the foreground too. Though, i think you did a nice job with the perspective, because the lake is really well positioned and the DOF is really nice in my opinion, i really like the details on that mountain at the back. There are some black spots at the sky too, hopelly not from your lens. The border is nice too.I''m not experient but i would try a really overexposed and a really underexposed shots to combine, i think that way you would have nice quality at the shadows (lake) and at the brighter parts.', '2009-09-21 00:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5655030, 820965, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the top of this shot. The sky and the leaves are looking great there. I''m not a fan of the perspective though. The floor and this left part of the shot with this weak light and saturation are not helpin there. But the HDR theme looks just fine for me there. With more saturation, more bright and a different perspective this would be really nice for me.</td>', 'I like the top of this shot. The sky and the leaves are looking great there. I''m not a fan of the perspective though. The floor and this left part of the shot with this weak light and saturation are not helpin there. But the HDR theme looks just fine for me there. With more saturation, more bright and a different perspective this would be really nice for me.', '2009-09-21 00:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
