(5655214, 820906, 83313, '<td valign="top">Came in way lower than I anticipated. I thought this was a surefire 6+, but then my vote was one of your 9''s.</td>', 'Came in way lower than I anticipated. I thought this was a surefire 6+, but then my vote was one of your 9''s.', '2009-09-21 01:40:51.000000', NULL, 0),
