(5655279, 821058, 67237, '<td valign="top">Glad to see you are making that 24-70 shine Erik. Congrats on the high finish with this great image!!!.</td>', 'Glad to see you are making that 24-70 shine Erik. Congrats on the high finish with this great image!!!.', '2009-09-21 02:11:03.000000', NULL, 0),
