(5655292, 819840, 38663, '<td valign="top">You have done a magnificent job of the HDR image and I love your story. Congrats on the ribbon.... well deserved.</td>', 'You have done a magnificent job of the HDR image and I love your story. Congrats on the ribbon.... well deserved.', '2009-09-21 02:31:25.000000', NULL, 0),
