(5655300, 820900, 52549, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rinac:</b></div><hr/><i> Still a very stunning image Irene. Maybe you just need to prop up one of the legs of your desk? ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL! Maybe I should just get a grid line display in my next glasses ;-))<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-21 01:47:23.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by rinac: Still a very stunning image Irene. Maybe you just need to prop up one of the legs of your desk? ;)  LOL! Maybe I should just get a grid line display in my next glasses ;-))', '2009-09-21 02:46:56.000000', '2009-09-21 02:47:23.000000', 0),
(5655305, 820923, 52549, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking image and a fantastic score. Huge congratulations, Richard.</td>', 'Breathtaking image and a fantastic score. Huge congratulations, Richard.', '2009-09-21 02:53:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655306, 820559, 32011, '<td valign="top">Stunning image and well deserving of the HM... you deservedly won this battle... until we next meet ;)<br/> <br/>Congratulation!</td>', 'Stunning image and well deserving of the HM... you deservedly won this battle... until we next meet ;) Congratulation!', '2009-09-21 02:53:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655310, 819840, 52549, '<td valign="top">I knew this beauty would ribbon as soon as I saw it during voting. Stunning shot and compelling story. Excellent work David, many congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'I knew this beauty would ribbon as soon as I saw it during voting. Stunning shot and compelling story. Excellent work David, many congrats on your ribbon.', '2009-09-21 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655311, 821078, 52549, '<td valign="top">Stunning image, love the colors. Congrats on your well deserved ribbon, Raj.</td>', 'Stunning image, love the colors. Congrats on your well deserved ribbon, Raj.', '2009-09-21 02:57:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655312, 820425, 32011, '<td valign="top">Finished over 6!  Well done... deserved a 6 at the very minimum.  Keeping your percentage of 6+ finished up there  :)</td>', 'Finished over 6!  Well done... deserved a 6 at the very minimum.  Keeping your percentage of 6+ finished up there  :)', '2009-09-21 02:58:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655314, 820410, 28322, '<td valign="top">Simply wonderful Vlad, love the tones and colors in here, the HDR is processed perfectly, not under nor over done in here, it is simply perfect. <br/>I am glad for this challenge, I wont many friends, you are on the top of the list :) <br/>P.S, I gave this one an 8,<br/>See ya in the next one. <br/>Cheers budd,</td>', 'Simply wonderful Vlad, love the tones and colors in here, the HDR is processed perfectly, not under nor over done in here, it is simply perfect. I am glad for this challenge, I wont many friends, you are on the top of the list :) P.S, I gave this one an 8,See ya in the next one. Cheers budd,', '2009-09-21 03:01:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655315, 820779, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congratulation on the HM, Alfredo. Your image is truly beautiful.</td>', 'Congratulation on the HM, Alfredo. Your image is truly beautiful.', '2009-09-21 03:02:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655318, 820923, 84668, '<td valign="top">Congrats! This image is wonderful! Could you please share the low res originals? I''d like to see from where the result came.... Thanks in advance!</td>', 'Congrats! This image is wonderful! Could you please share the low res originals? I''d like to see from where the result came.... Thanks in advance!', '2009-09-21 03:07:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655323, 820923, 63503, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. Big congratulations on the super score and the well deserved blue rbbon.</td>', 'Stunning image. Big congratulations on the super score and the well deserved blue rbbon.', '2009-09-21 03:23:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655324, 819840, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Congratulations on the red.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Congratulations on the red.', '2009-09-21 03:24:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655325, 821078, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture. Congrats on the yellow, Raj.</td>', 'Very pretty picture. Congrats on the yellow, Raj.', '2009-09-21 03:25:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655328, 820959, 59684, '<td valign="top">Flott mynd hjá þér Jói!</td>', 'Flott mynd hjá þér Jói!', '2009-09-21 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655329, 821071, 28322, '<td valign="top">Strong Entry Wendy, deserves to tops, I remember how I liked the picture when I first saw it, <br/>What grabbed my attention at first wasn''t the HDR, it was the balance between the light outside and inside, how you managed to get the trees to show, which in my humble opinion reflects good photography skills, mostly people would over expose the exterior, <br/>Thats said, I gave this image an 8, very well done, <br/>P.S, Couldn''t help but to realize your front page''s challenges entries are filled with stars and ribbons :) way to go :) <br/></td>', 'Strong Entry Wendy, deserves to tops, I remember how I liked the picture when I first saw it, What grabbed my attention at first wasn''t the HDR, it was the balance between the light outside and inside, how you managed to get the trees to show, which in my humble opinion reflects good photography skills, mostly people would over expose the exterior, Thats said, I gave this image an 8, very well done, P.S, Couldn''t help but to realize your front page''s challenges entries are filled with stars and ribbons :) way to go :) ', '2009-09-21 03:27:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655334, 821005, 69368, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see this in the Top 10! Congrats!</td>', 'I''m glad to see this in the Top 10! Congrats!', '2009-09-21 03:38:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655335, 820923, 39349, '<td valign="top">Congrats and beautiful image, well deserved blue.</td>', 'Congrats and beautiful image, well deserved blue.', '2009-09-21 03:40:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655336, 820795, 81530, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at all those comments! Great shot buddy.</td>', 'Wow, look at all those comments! Great shot buddy.', '2009-09-21 03:41:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655338, 821097, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great shot buddy. I could learn a few things from you. Gave you an 8</td>', 'Great shot buddy. I could learn a few things from you. Gave you an 8', '2009-09-21 03:43:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655339, 820758, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... <br/> <br/>I reckon this subject had some wonderful potential.  A tighter crop (remove much of the right) and a little tweaking of the HDR to reduce the blacks and halo in the clouds and this would have faired much better.  I think this image as it is suffered b/c it fell between the pigeon holes of landscape and mechanical, and also b/c it feels a little over processed.  I do like the subject, the details and the colours in the shot... I''d love to see some outtakes or this one reprocessed, as I think you could get a top 10 from it.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...  I reckon this subject had some wonderful potential.  A tighter crop (remove much of the right) and a little tweaking of the HDR to reduce the blacks and halo in the clouds and this would have faired much better.  I think this image as it is suffered b/c it fell between the pigeon holes of landscape and mechanical, and also b/c it feels a little over processed.  I do like the subject, the details and the colours in the shot... I''d love to see some outtakes or this one reprocessed, as I think you could get a top 10 from it.', '2009-09-21 03:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655341, 820923, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Richard! An absolutely stunning image.</td>', 'Congratulations, Richard! An absolutely stunning image.', '2009-09-21 03:45:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655342, 819840, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a great image and a helluva score!</td>', 'Congrats on a great image and a helluva score!', '2009-09-21 03:46:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655344, 821078, 28742, '<td valign="top">Spectacular! Congrats!</td>', 'Spectacular! Congrats!', '2009-09-21 03:46:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655346, 821071, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...<br/> <br/>I like the minimalism of this image, and love the balance it has.  The window and the tub (?) in the table... superbly balanced.  This is an excellent example of where HDR can be used well.  I think this may have suffered a little from the voters that punish anything with too much of the HDR black/grit or haloing as "overprocessed".  Despite this, it''s done quite well.  Congratulation on an excellent HDR entry.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... I like the minimalism of this image, and love the balance it has.  The window and the tub (?) in the table... superbly balanced.  This is an excellent example of where HDR can be used well.  I think this may have suffered a little from the voters that punish anything with too much of the HDR black/grit or haloing as "overprocessed".  Despite this, it''s done quite well.  Congratulation on an excellent HDR entry.', '2009-09-21 03:52:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655351, 820410, 81530, '<td valign="top">A hole in one! Well done!<br/> <br/>ETA: Oops, forgot this wasn''t a DPC Golf entry. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-21 02:57:24.</i></td>', 'A hole in one! Well done! ETA: Oops, forgot this wasn''t a DPC Golf entry. ', '2009-09-21 03:56:31.000000', '2009-09-21 03:57:24.000000', 0),
(5655354, 820838, 81530, '<td valign="top">Highly underrated.</td>', 'Highly underrated.', '2009-09-21 04:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655355, 821098, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...<br/> <br/>I really love the clouds, composition and colours in this shot and the details you''ve managed to get in the sand with your HDR processing.  I feel the ONE thing that hurt this image was the pixelation (from sharpening perhaps?) around the structure... as your eye is naturally drawn to the subject, and then the pixelation just really jars.  I reckon this would have easily been a top 10 if not for that one little issue... but having just looked at the other comments, perhaps its just me that the pixelation is an issue with.  Anyway... I''d love to see this if you reprocessed it with the comments it got in mind.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... I really love the clouds, composition and colours in this shot and the details you''ve managed to get in the sand with your HDR processing.  I feel the ONE thing that hurt this image was the pixelation (from sharpening perhaps?) around the structure... as your eye is naturally drawn to the subject, and then the pixelation just really jars.  I reckon this would have easily been a top 10 if not for that one little issue... but having just looked at the other comments, perhaps its just me that the pixelation is an issue with.  Anyway... I''d love to see this if you reprocessed it with the comments it got in mind.', '2009-09-21 04:00:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655356, 820526, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2009-09-21 04:00:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655357, 820891, 81530, '<td valign="top">Highly underrated. Gave it an 8.</td>', 'Highly underrated. Gave it an 8.', '2009-09-21 04:01:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655359, 820373, 81530, '<td valign="top">This is awesome! Got a 9 from me. Surprised it didn''t fair better.</td>', 'This is awesome! Got a 9 from me. Surprised it didn''t fair better.', '2009-09-21 04:01:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655361, 821053, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...<br/> <br/>Nice image, though I think I''d have preferred it in colour.  The effect of the chrome may have been lost a little by going to B&amp;W with this, IMO...</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... Nice image, though I think I''d have preferred it in colour.  The effect of the chrome may have been lost a little by going to B&W with this, IMO...', '2009-09-21 04:03:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655362, 820977, 81530, '<td valign="top">I had a feeling this was yours. 7 from me.</td>', 'I had a feeling this was yours. 7 from me.', '2009-09-21 04:03:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655364, 820923, 81530, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Well done.</td>', 'Stunning. Well done.', '2009-09-21 04:05:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655365, 819840, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great shot and finish!</td>', 'Great shot and finish!', '2009-09-21 04:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655366, 821078, 81530, '<td valign="top">What an awesome view!</td>', 'What an awesome view!', '2009-09-21 04:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655367, 820923, 92577, '<td valign="top">During the voting, my daughter saw me at the computer and asked me how my picture was doing. ''Pretty good'', I said, ''But there are some strong contenders out there, look at this one for example.'' I showed her yours.<br/>''Hmm,'' she said.<br/>''I think it might be ever so slightly tilted.'' I said. <br/>''No. that''s an optical illusion'' she replied.<br/>''Oh'' I said.<br/>-----------------------<br/>Congrats on the blue, an 8 and a new PB - not a bad tally.<br/>(Also, thanks for the heads-up on the photomatix upgrade)</td>', 'During the voting, my daughter saw me at the computer and asked me how my picture was doing. ''Pretty good'', I said, ''But there are some strong contenders out there, look at this one for example.'' I showed her yours.''Hmm,'' she said.''I think it might be ever so slightly tilted.'' I said. ''No. that''s an optical illusion'' she replied.''Oh'' I said.-----------------------Congrats on the blue, an 8 and a new PB - not a bad tally.(Also, thanks for the heads-up on the photomatix upgrade)', '2009-09-21 04:08:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655370, 821096, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...<br/> <br/>I love this photo and am surprised it didn''t do better in the challenge.  I have no idea why, but perhaps b/c it may have been, as you said, not HDR-y enough.  Shame.  Composition, detail, colour... all wonderful, although, perhaps not enough colour for the DPC audience.  That said, I wouldn''t change a single thing in the image.  Love it.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... I love this photo and am surprised it didn''t do better in the challenge.  I have no idea why, but perhaps b/c it may have been, as you said, not HDR-y enough.  Shame.  Composition, detail, colour... all wonderful, although, perhaps not enough colour for the DPC audience.  That said, I wouldn''t change a single thing in the image.  Love it.', '2009-09-21 04:11:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655374, 820791, 32011, '<td valign="top">Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties...<br/> <br/>I commented on this during voting, and I have to now say, this is by far the most under rated, under appreciated image of the challenge, in that I think it deserves to finish MUCH higher, score MUCH higher than it did in the end.  I think 6.8+ is more like where it deserved to be which would have put you in the top 10... in my books... even with the issues I highlighted in my original comment.<br/> <br/>I love the composition... I love the colour of the sky.  Hell, I like this so much, I think it deserves a fav.</td>', 'Commenting as part of my Team Suck duties... I commented on this during voting, and I have to now say, this is by far the most under rated, under appreciated image of the challenge, in that I think it deserves to finish MUCH higher, score MUCH higher than it did in the end.  I think 6.8+ is more like where it deserved to be which would have put you in the top 10... in my books... even with the issues I highlighted in my original comment. I love the composition... I love the colour of the sky.  Hell, I like this so much, I think it deserves a fav.', '2009-09-21 04:16:14.000000', NULL, 0),
