(5655390, 821005, 109297, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gg3rd:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s an interesting image that tells a story. I like many elements here: the roof, the furnace, the cart,  the fence on left, the hut''s walls, the tire atop the clay shingles pile and, last, what makes it the most: the posing lady, who seems happy despite the humble circunstances. Nice work.<br/>I just don''t like your interpretation and find unfair - and a bit judgemental &amp; depreciative - the title you gave. (Well, I might sound judgemental here too, but that`s a prerrogative I won`t waive... :-) ) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There is likely more to the title then listed on the comments about it. Maybe this lady told him she was a witch. I am sure there are people out there practicing some sort of witchcraft that are friendy. I don''t know any personally, but find your comment funny.</td>', 'Originally posted by gg3rd: It''s an interesting image that tells a story. I like many elements here: the roof, the furnace, the cart,  the fence on left, the hut''s walls, the tire atop the clay shingles pile and, last, what makes it the most: the posing lady, who seems happy despite the humble circunstances. Nice work.I just don''t like your interpretation and find unfair - and a bit judgemental & depreciative - the title you gave. (Well, I might sound judgemental here too, but that`s a prerrogative I won`t waive... :-) )   There is likely more to the title then listed on the comments about it. Maybe this lady told him she was a witch. I am sure there are people out there practicing some sort of witchcraft that are friendy. I don''t know any personally, but find your comment funny.', '2009-09-21 04:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655398, 820771, 109297, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....I am not sure why yours did not place in at least the top five....I was picking yours to win.</td>', 'Hmmm....I am not sure why yours did not place in at least the top five....I was picking yours to win.', '2009-09-21 04:55:44.000000', NULL, 0),
