(5655410, 820923, 79602, '<td valign="top">Richard, this is pure magic!  I''m sad now, because on our honeymoon trip to Estes Park, we missed Bear Lake.  We set out to see it, but turned back after a good distance when bad weather started to set in.  Thank you for filling in the blanks! ;)<br/> <br/>Congrats on this most deserved blue and an incredible score!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-21 04:28:46.</i></td>', 'Richard, this is pure magic!  I''m sad now, because on our honeymoon trip to Estes Park, we missed Bear Lake.  We set out to see it, but turned back after a good distance when bad weather started to set in.  Thank you for filling in the blanks! ;) Congrats on this most deserved blue and an incredible score!', '2009-09-21 05:28:14.000000', '2009-09-21 05:28:46.000000', 0),
