(5655494, 821036, 99506, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ColemanGariety:</b></div><hr/><i> But it doesn''t look like you put any effort to make this HDR at all... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I rarely feel the need to counter someone in comments like this, but there is clearly effort behind this. It may not have come off with as much visual impact as other entries in this challenge, but without the use of HDR this would have been a dark tunnel, and it certainly shows the use of the technique. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m with Steve on this one, it is clearly HDR and very well done at that</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Originally posted by ColemanGariety: But it doesn''t look like you put any effort to make this HDR at all...  I rarely feel the need to counter someone in comments like this, but there is clearly effort behind this. It may not have come off with as much visual impact as other entries in this challenge, but without the use of HDR this would have been a dark tunnel, and it certainly shows the use of the technique.   I''m with Steve on this one, it is clearly HDR and very well done at that', '2009-09-21 08:34:57.000000', NULL, 0),
