(5655784, 820923, 69668, '<td valign="top">HOLY COW....an 8 plus score.  A HUGE congrats to you.  It was my favorite image and is just stunning!!!!</td>', 'HOLY COW....an 8 plus score.  A HUGE congrats to you.  It was my favorite image and is just stunning!!!!', '2009-09-21 12:49:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655797, 820923, 22537, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image Richard. I had to throw on a jacket just to look at it. I think the thing which impresses me most is how you managed to manipulate the image just enough to make it life like. Yes, thats exactly it ..... LIFE LIKE. I''ve been to many lakes just like this and feel the chill, smell the trees and fear the damn cold water!! ;-) Congrats on an epic win!</td>', 'Gorgeous image Richard. I had to throw on a jacket just to look at it. I think the thing which impresses me most is how you managed to manipulate the image just enough to make it life like. Yes, thats exactly it ..... LIFE LIKE. I''ve been to many lakes just like this and feel the chill, smell the trees and fear the damn cold water!! ;-) Congrats on an epic win!', '2009-09-21 12:55:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655798, 820923, 65083, '<td valign="top">Way to go we do live in a great state.</td>', 'Way to go we do live in a great state.', '2009-09-21 12:55:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655812, 819840, 65083, '<td valign="top">what a great story to go with a great photo, congrats.</td>', 'what a great story to go with a great photo, congrats.', '2009-09-21 12:58:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655815, 821078, 65083, '<td valign="top">wow congrats</td>', 'wow congrats', '2009-09-21 12:59:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5655818, 821033, 67152, '<td valign="top">Chris - I liked your entry - especially the simple, straightforward composition and layers created by the hills and clouds.  I think you have a bit of noise going on, especially in the cloud layers.  That probably cost you a bit on the score.  I would give Photomatix pro a go (you can download it for trial) and see how it treats the images).  I have noticed a lot less noise issues with Photomatic Pro in their latest version.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Chris - I liked your entry - especially the simple, straightforward composition and layers created by the hills and clouds.  I think you have a bit of noise going on, especially in the cloud layers.  That probably cost you a bit on the score.  I would give Photomatix pro a go (you can download it for trial) and see how it treats the images).  I have noticed a lot less noise issues with Photomatic Pro in their latest version. ', '2009-09-21 13:00:02.000000', NULL, 0),
