(5655934, 821098, 52449, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your (good and not-so-good) comments!<br/> <br/>Specifically,<br/> <br/><b>@bassbone</b>, <b>@vlado</b>:<br/>Here is another version of the same image, with a little of the oversharpening removed around the lifeguard stand. It''s difficult, at best, to remove all the sharpening artifacts when tone-mapping to that extreme.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/gainous/3940586335/sizes/o/in/set-72157603882340839/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm4.static.flickr.com/3531/3940586335_7956f833b9_t.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm4.static.flickr.com/3531/3940586335_7956f833b9_t.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm4.static.flickr.com/3531/3940586335_7956f833b9_t.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/><b>@kivgaen</b>:<br/>It was relatively dark that evening. Have you calibrated your monitor?  ;-)<br/> <br/><b>@LadyK</b>:<br/>Yours was a unique comment. Everyone that thought it was overprocessed didn''t seem to like it. You said it was overprocessed, but liked it! Thanks!<br/> <br/><b>@ineedauniquename</b>:<br/>The title is an abstract title.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-21 15:04:16.</i></td>', 'Thanks everyone for your (good and not-so-good) comments! Specifically, @bassbone, @vlado:Here is another version of the same image, with a little of the oversharpening removed around the lifeguard stand. It''s difficult, at best, to remove all the sharpening artifacts when tone-mapping to that extreme.   @kivgaen:It was relatively dark that evening. Have you calibrated your monitor?  ;-) @LadyK:Yours was a unique comment. Everyone that thought it was overprocessed didn''t seem to like it. You said it was overprocessed, but liked it! Thanks! @ineedauniquename:The title is an abstract title.', '2009-09-21 15:06:24.000000', '2009-09-21 16:04:16.000000', 0),
