(5656001, 820923, 108580, '<td valign="top">Just magnificent. In the 80''s my old man bought a few oils from an Aussy outback painter named Jack Absalom whilst visiting his studio in Broken Hill (I bought a few prints). Your feather light use of HDR reminded me of some of his work. Brilliance but not overdone. WD and well deserved, despite stiff competition.</td>', 'Just magnificent. In the 80''s my old man bought a few oils from an Aussy outback painter named Jack Absalom whilst visiting his studio in Broken Hill (I bought a few prints). Your feather light use of HDR reminded me of some of his work. Brilliance but not overdone. WD and well deserved, despite stiff competition.', '2009-09-21 16:08:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5656010, 820889, 67723, '<td valign="top">wow I used to live in Minnesota and I''ve never seen that orange of a sky... either it''s fake or it was a totally amazing real life experience.</td>', 'wow I used to live in Minnesota and I''ve never seen that orange of a sky... either it''s fake or it was a totally amazing real life experience.', '2009-09-21 16:11:58.000000', NULL, 0),
