(5656699, 820206, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like we both kicked butt with non-SLR''s in the HDR challenge. Good going. Nobody around here had better blame their scores on the camera! Well, maybe if someone is using a Barbie Glam-cam, they could get away with it.</td>', 'Looks like we both kicked butt with non-SLR''s in the HDR challenge. Good going. Nobody around here had better blame their scores on the camera! Well, maybe if someone is using a Barbie Glam-cam, they could get away with it.', '2009-09-21 23:38:51.000000', NULL, 0),
