(5657621, 821090, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like this image but why HDR? The whole point is to increase dynamic range. Your scene should have had everything exposed properly to begin with. Just curious...</td>', 'I like this image but why HDR? The whole point is to increase dynamic range. Your scene should have had everything exposed properly to begin with. Just curious...', '2009-09-22 17:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
