(5659018, 820941, 51269, '<td valign="top">The light in the tower is so warm &amp; glowing to contrast with the mellow light on the church-well done !!!</td>', 'The light in the tower is so warm & glowing to contrast with the mellow light on the church-well done !!!', '2009-09-23 10:26:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5659038, 821012, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely real.  What''s in the tree on the left?  And you wouldn''t catch me standing that close to the edge with a camera... cameras often distort the where you are bit.  I don''t have a fear of heights, but I have a fear of falling, and this shot makes me just a wee bit nervous.  And why is it people don''t like people in shots?  I''ve never quite figured that out.</td>', 'Nicely real.  What''s in the tree on the left?  And you wouldn''t catch me standing that close to the edge with a camera... cameras often distort the where you are bit.  I don''t have a fear of heights, but I have a fear of falling, and this shot makes me just a wee bit nervous.  And why is it people don''t like people in shots?  I''ve never quite figured that out.', '2009-09-23 10:30:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5659041, 820959, 109953, '<td valign="top">Glæsileg. I like.</td>', 'Glæsileg. I like.', '2009-09-23 10:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5659080, 821091, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>You asked for your shot to have a comment by one of the members of the Critique club<br/> <br/>this is a very clean cut shot.  your sharpness is spot on, clarity is good, DOF and POV are very good. IT just does not look HDR and that is really the only problem you have going on here. <br/> <br/>The other shot that you put up, is 100% better than this shot in every way.  You have the action, the dodge and burn is excellent and the POV is outstanding.  But most importantly it does look HDR. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club You asked for your shot to have a comment by one of the members of the Critique club this is a very clean cut shot.  your sharpness is spot on, clarity is good, DOF and POV are very good. IT just does not look HDR and that is really the only problem you have going on here.  The other shot that you put up, is 100% better than this shot in every way.  You have the action, the dodge and burn is excellent and the POV is outstanding.  But most importantly it does look HDR.  ', '2009-09-23 10:53:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5659103, 820716, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club <br/> <br/>You asked for your shot to have a comment by one of the members of the Critique club <br/> <br/>Lovely shot, i really like it.  <br/> <br/>The comments that you have received pretty much tell you all you need to know with this shot.  A fast shutter speed would maybe illuminate the blurry boats.  A little more saturation or selective colour would have given your colours some more depth.  You have some in camera splotches in the top left corner that you could clone in in Advanced editing. <br/> <br/>Overall a pretty shot, well done</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club  You asked for your shot to have a comment by one of the members of the Critique club  Lovely shot, i really like it.   The comments that you have received pretty much tell you all you need to know with this shot.  A fast shutter speed would maybe illuminate the blurry boats.  A little more saturation or selective colour would have given your colours some more depth.  You have some in camera splotches in the top left corner that you could clone in in Advanced editing.  Overall a pretty shot, well done', '2009-09-23 10:59:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5659208, 821053, 50641, '<td valign="top">chrome-a-licious... has a very vintage feel.</td>', 'chrome-a-licious... has a very vintage feel.', '2009-09-23 11:58:14.000000', NULL, 0),
