(5659291, 820795, 35357, '<td valign="top">Nice finish, even with 4 haters.  Cheers!<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=820872" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/35357/120/820872.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/35357/120/820872.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/35357/120/820872.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=819841" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/35357/120/819841.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/35357/120/819841.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/35357/120/819841.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-23 12:21:33.</i></td>', 'Nice finish, even with 4 haters.  Cheers!  ', '2009-09-23 13:15:05.000000', '2009-09-23 13:21:33.000000', 0),
