(5956114, 820986, 65886, '<td valign="top">i like it a lot! the idea, the subtle hdr - perfect and not over-the-top. i think though the image would benifit a bit more from a slightly different lighting. maybe more dramatic? if for example only the middle with the flower would be lit, while the sides would be darker, don''t you think it would look a bit more put together? maybe i''d increase contrast a bit as well, just play around with some editing. it looks a bit too flat the way it is now, so playing with light and contrast would give the photo more depth and interest and also would help the viewrs to focus on the most important here - the red rose.<br/>amazing though that you took it with powershot:) i read in your profile that you''d love to learn photography, i am sure you''ll do very good. good luck! just don''t stop trying!</td>', 'i like it a lot! the idea, the subtle hdr - perfect and not over-the-top. i think though the image would benifit a bit more from a slightly different lighting. maybe more dramatic? if for example only the middle with the flower would be lit, while the sides would be darker, don''t you think it would look a bit more put together? maybe i''d increase contrast a bit as well, just play around with some editing. it looks a bit too flat the way it is now, so playing with light and contrast would give the photo more depth and interest and also would help the viewrs to focus on the most important here - the red rose.amazing though that you took it with powershot:) i read in your profile that you''d love to learn photography, i am sure you''ll do very good. good luck! just don''t stop trying!', '2010-04-19 17:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
